"use strict";(self.webpackChunku_modeler_manual=self.webpackChunku_modeler_manual||[]).push([[11477],{30010:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"blogPosts":[{"id":"/unity-modeling-tools","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/unity-modeling-tools","source":"@site/blog/2025-9-05/unity_modeling_tools_comparison.md","title":"Modeling Tools in Unity: UModeler X vs ProBuilder vs Blender","description":"Compare UModeler X, ProBuilder, and Blender \u2014 learn their strengths, workflows, and which modeling tool fits best into your Unity projects.","date":"2025-09-05T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"September 5, 2025","tags":[],"readingTime":4.855,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"Sora Chae","title":"Marketing Manager","email":"sora.c@umodeler.com","key":"sora"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Modeling Tools in Unity: UModeler X vs ProBuilder vs Blender","description":"Compare UModeler X, ProBuilder, and Blender \u2014 learn their strengths, workflows, and which modeling tool fits best into your Unity projects.","keywords":["umodeler unity","umodeler x pro","unity probuilder vs umodeler","umodeler vs blender","unity modeling tools","unity level design","prototyping","3d modeling","blockout"],"slug":"/unity-modeling-tools","authors":["sora"]},"nextItem":{"title":"Famous Theme Park Game Success Stories & Unity Asset | UModeler X","permalink":"/blog/theme-park-success"}},"content":"![](./img/ToolVS.webp)\\n\\n---  \\n\\n## Why Modeling Tools Matter in Unity  \\n\\nUnity is one of the most popular game engines used by developers and artists worldwide.  \\n\\nTraditionally, 3D models were created in external DCC (Digital Content Creation) tools and then imported into Unity.  \\n\\nThis workflow works well for high-quality assets, but it\u2019s often inefficient for prototyping, iteration, and level blockouts. Recently, modeling tools built directly into Unity have matured, giving developers more flexible workflows. Two key examples are UModeler X and ProBuilder.  \\n\\nAt the same time, external creation is still common\u2014and among external tools, Blender stands out as the most widely used free and open-source option.  \\n\\n---  \\n\\n## Overview of the Three Tools  \\n\\n\\n### UModeler X \u2013 Your 3D Assistant in Unity  \\n\\nUModeler X is an all-in-one solution inside the Unity editor, offering polygon modeling, UV unwrapping/editing, texturing and painting, basic sculpting, simple rigging, Curve Mesh modeling, Push-Pull (SketchUp style), and even auto-retopology.  \\n\\nWith no need to switch tools, you can quickly turn ideas into 3D models and test them instantly inside Unity.  \\n\\nIt gives level designers, programmers, and tech artists a strong advantage through **fast iteration and an optimized Unity workflow**.  \\n\\n### ProBuilder \u2013 Fast and Intuitive Prototyping  \\n\\nProBuilder is Unity\u2019s official free modeling tool, designed for **quick blockouts and level prototyping** using primitive shapes and simple polygon editing.  \\n\\nIt doesn\u2019t provide advanced features like texturing, sculpting, rigging, or auto-retopology.  \\n\\nThis makes it ideal for **fast, free blockouts**, but less suited for final asset creation.  \\n\\n\ud83d\udc49 If you want both **rapid prototyping and a streamlined Unity workflow**, UModeler X goes beyond basic editing\u2014it acts as your **3D Assistant**.  \\n\\n### Blender \u2013 A Free and Powerful Full-Stack 3D Tool  \\n\\nBlender covers the full 3D pipeline: modeling, texturing, rigging, animation, rendering, and more. It\u2019s free, open-source, and supported by a massive community, making it a reliable choice for both indie and AAA development.  \\n\\nHowever, Blender works independently from Unity, meaning you\u2019ll need to export/import assets (FBX, GLTF, etc.). While this adds extra steps, Blender is still essential for creating **high-quality assets with maximum flexibility and detail**.  \\n\\n---  \\n\\n## Feature Comparison  \\n\\n\\n\\n| Feature / Tool | **UModeler X** | **ProBuilder** | **Blender** |  \\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |  \\n| **In-Unity Modeling** | \u2705 Advanced (polygon-level) | \u2705 Basic modeling | \u274c External tool required |  \\n| **UV Editing** | \u2705 Supported | \u26a0\ufe0f Basic only | \u2705 Advanced |  \\n| **Painting** | \u2705 Supported | \u274c Not supported | \u2705 Advanced (nodes, baking, etc.) |  \\n| **Polygon Modeling** | \u2705 Precise | \u26a0\ufe0f Limited | \u2705 High/Low poly capable |  \\n| **Curve Mesh Modeling** | \u2705 Supported  | \u26a0\ufe0f Basic only | \u2705 Advanced (NURBS) |  \\n| **Push-Pull (SketchUp Style)** | \u2705 Intuitive (line & face based) | \u274c Not supported | \u26a0\ufe0f Possible, less intuitive |  \\n| **Rigging** | \u2705 Basic support | \u274c Not supported | \u2705 Advanced |  \\n| **Sculpting** | \u2705 Basic features | \u274c Not supported | \u2705 Advanced (high-poly detail) |  \\n| **Auto Retopology** | \u2705 Supported (simpler than Blender) | \u274c Not supported | \u2705 Advanced (manual/auto) |  \\n| **Workflow Efficiency** | \ud83d\ude80 Very high (no tool switching) | \u26a0\ufe0f Limited (blockout-focused) | \u274c Lower (export/import required) |  \\n| **Learning Curve** | \ud83d\ude42 Moderate (Unity-friendly) | \u2705 Easy (quick to learn) | \ud83d\udca1 Steep (but well-documented) |  \\n| **Price** | Paid (Pro/Personal/Plus) | Free | Free |  \\n\\n\\n\\n---  \\n\\n## Workflow & Learning Curve  \\n\\n### ProBuilder \u2013 Light and Fast  \\n\\nThe biggest advantage of **ProBuilder** is accessibility. **Anyone can pick it up directly inside Unity**, making it great for quick blockouts or simple structures. However, its limited feature set means you\u2019ll eventually need an external tool for full production.  \\n\\n### Blender \u2013 Powerful but Demanding  \\n\\n**Blender** is extremely **powerful and covers everything** from modeling to animation and rendering. The downside is its steep learning curve and the need for export/import steps when working with Unity. For beginners, it can feel overwhelming\u2014but for those who stick with it, Blender becomes an invaluable long-term tool.  \\n\\n### UModeler X \u2013 The 3D Assistant in Unity  \\n\\n**UModeler X** excels at fast iteration, letting you model directly in Unity and test results immediately. Its Unity-friendly interface makes it easier to learn than Blender, while its all-in-one toolset saves you from constantly switching software. That\u2019s why it truly works as a **\u201c3D Assistant\u201d** within Unity workflows.  \\n\\n---  \\n\\n## Pricing & Accessibility  \\n\\n![](./img/Skipexport.webp)\\n\\n- **ProBuilder**: Free, officially provided by **Unity\u2014accessible to everyone**.  \\n- **Blender**: Free and open-source, with **a wide feature set and strong community support**.  \\n- **UModeler X**: Paid plugin, but its **workflow efficiency** and **time-saving benefits** make it well worth the investment.  \\n\\n---  \\n\\n## Which Tool Should You Choose?  \\n\\n- For **quick prototypes and blockouts** \u2192 ProBuilder  \\n- For **full-stack 3D creation and high-quality assets** \u2192 Blender  \\n- For **maximizing iteration speed and productivity in Unity** \u2192 UModeler X  \\n\\n---  \\n\\n## Conclusion: Your 3D Assistant in Unity  \\n\\nFor smaller projects or simpler workflows, UModeler X alone can take you from modeling to texturing without leaving Unity.  \\n\\nFor projects requiring top-quality assets, Blender remains indispensable.  \\n\\nBut rather than thinking of them as alternatives, it\u2019s better to see them as **complementary**. Blender handles high-quality asset creation, while UModeler X assists with fast adjustments, fine-tuning, and iteration once those assets are in Unity.  \\n\\nIn fact, combining Blender and UModeler X gives you the best of both worlds: **artistic quality and development efficiency**.  \\n\\n---  \\n\\n**UModeler X \u2013 Your 3D Assistant in Unity.**\\n\\nVisualize ideas faster. Streamline your workflow.  \\n\\n<div style={{ display: \\"flex\\", flexWrap: \\"wrap\\", gap: \\"20px\\", marginTop: \\"20px\\" }}>\\n  <div style={{ flex: 1, minWidth: \\"200px\\", textAlign: \\"center\\", border: \\"1px solid #eaeaea\\", borderRadius: \\"12px\\", padding: \\"20px\\" }}>\\n    <h3>UModelerX</h3>\\n    <p>Try it for free now!</p>\\n    <a href=\\"https://unity.umodeler.com/Price\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style={{ display: \\"inline-block\\", background: \\"#6c5ce7\\", color: \\"#fff\\", padding: \\"10px 20px\\", borderRadius: \\"8px\\", textDecoration: \\"none\\" }}>Get Started \u2197</a>\\n  </div>\\n</div>"},{"id":"/theme-park-success","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/theme-park-success","source":"@site/blog/2025-9-04/2025-9-04.md","title":"Famous Theme Park Game Success Stories & Unity Asset | UModeler X","description":"Discover why RollerCoaster Tycoon, Planet Coaster, and more became iconic \u2014 and how UModeler X\u2019s Theme Park asset helps you build your own amusement park in Unity.","date":"2025-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"September 4, 2025","tags":[],"readingTime":4.855,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"Sora Chae","title":"Marketing Manager","email":"sora.c@umodeler.com","key":"sora"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Famous Theme Park Game Success Stories & Unity Asset | UModeler X","description":"Discover why RollerCoaster Tycoon, Planet Coaster, and more became iconic \u2014 and how UModeler X\u2019s Theme Park asset helps you build your own amusement park in Unity.","keywords":["theme park games","unity theme park asset","umodeler unity","rollercoaster tycoon","planet coaster"],"slug":"/theme-park-success","authors":["sora"]},"prevItem":{"title":"Modeling Tools in Unity: UModeler X vs ProBuilder vs Blender","permalink":"/blog/unity-modeling-tools"},"nextItem":{"title":"New Asset Update for Hyper-Casual Game Creators: Introducing Sea Otter Chef!","permalink":"/blog/new-available-SeaOtterChef"}},"content":"---\\n\\n## Why Do Theme Park Games Stay Popular?  \\nTheme parks have always been places of joy and excitement. Everyone has memories of thrilling rides, parades, and cozy cafes \u2014 so it\u2019s no surprise that games based on **theme park management and simulation** have been popular for decades.  \\n\\nThese games let players design and run their own amusement parks, combining the joy of creativity with the challenge of business strategy. Let\u2019s take a closer look at some of the **most successful theme park games**, and then see how you can build your own theme park experience directly inside Unity with UModeler X\u2019s brand-new **\u2018Theme Park\u2019 asset**.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Classic Theme Park Game Success Stories  \\n\\n### \ud83c\udfa2 RollerCoaster Tycoon  \\n![](./img/RollerCoasterTycoon.png)\\n- **Release:** 1999, developed by Chris Sawyer\\n- **Why It Succeeded:**\\n  - Stunning graphics and a realistic physics engine that made the park feel alive\\n  - Extreme freedom to customize every detail \u2014 from buildings to lighting and music\\n  - Most importantly, a strong **community of creators** emerged. Players shared their rides and park designs with each other, constantly inspiring new ideas and keeping the game fun for years.\\n- **Learn More:** [Wikipedia \u2197](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RollerCoaster_Tycoon) | [Steam Page \u2197](https://store.steampowered.com/app/285310/RollerCoaster_Tycoon_Deluxe/)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### \ud83c\udf0d Planet Coaster\\n![](./img/PlanetCoaster.png)\\n- **Release:** 2016, by Frontier Developments\\n- **Why It Succeeded:**\\n  - Stunning graphics and a realistic physics engine that made the park feel alive\\n  - Extreme freedom to customize every detail \u2014 from buildings to lighting and music\\n  - Most importantly, a strong **community of creators** emerged. Players shared their rides and park designs with each other, constantly inspiring new ideas and keeping the game fun for years.\\n- **Learn More:** [Official Website \u2197](https://www.planetcoaster.com/) | [Steam Page \u2197](https://store.steampowered.com/app/493340/Planet_Coaster/)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### \ud83c\udfa0 Theme Park\\n![](./img/ThemePark.png)\\n- **Release:** 1994, developed by Bullfrog, designed by Peter Molyneux\\n- **Why It Succeeded:**\\n  - One of the very first theme park management sims, paving the way for the genre\\n  - Memorable humor and quirky animations when guests complained or the park failed\\n  - Balanced business management with light-hearted fun\\n- **Learn More:** [Wikipedia \u2197](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theme_Park_(video_game)) | [MobyGames \u2197](https://www.mobygames.com/game/theme-park)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Parkitect\\n![](./img/Parkitect.png)\\n- **Release:** 2018, indie game\\n- **Why It Succeeded:**\\n  - Charming, nostalgic graphics reminiscent of RollerCoaster Tycoon 1 & 2\\n  - New management features like staff-only areas and supply logistics\\n  - A polished indie title that won over both classic fans and new players\\n- **Learn More:** [Official Website \u2197](https://themeparkitect.com/) | [Steam Page \u2197](https://store.steampowered.com/app/453090/Parkitect/)\\n\\n\\n---\\n\\n## What Makes Theme Park Games Fun?  \\nAcross all these titles, one thing stands out: the **joy of creating your own dream world**. Building a space where guests explore, ride attractions, and react to your ideas is endlessly satisfying.  \\n\\nAnd this magic isn\u2019t just in the past \u2014 today\u2019s developers can still capture it. But now, you don\u2019t need years of resources to start building. With the right tools, you can design a living, breathing theme park world directly inside Unity.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Introducing the New **\u2018Theme Park\u2019 Asset** for Unity  \\n\\nWith UModeler X, we\u2019re excited to release **\u2018Theme Park\u2019**, a ready-to-use asset pack designed for **hyper-casual and casual adventure games**. It\u2019s more than just props \u2014 it\u2019s a complete playground for your ideas.  \\n<div style={{ display: \'flex\', flexWrap: \'wrap\', gap: \'15px\', marginBottom: \'20px\' }}>\\n    <div style={{ width: \'calc(33.33% - 10px)\' }}>\\n        <iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vuTuMX-KTcI?si=q4JmEjafybU_z5zo\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" referrerpolicy=\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n### **What\u2019s Inside?**  \\n- \ud83c\udfa2 **Ride Animations**: Ready-made rides like Ranger and Drop Tower  \\n- \ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f **Ticket Booth & Park Props**: Perfect for a realistic entrance setup  \\n- \u2615 **Cafe & Restaurant Areas**: Chairs, tables, and cozy decorations  \\n- \ud83c\udf86 **Fireworks Particles**: Add festival vibes and celebration scenes  \\n- \ud83c\udfae **UModeler X Compatibility**: Edit meshes, UVs, and recolor directly in Unity  \\n\\n<div style={{ \\n    display: \'flex\', \\n    gap: \'10px\', \\n    marginBottom: \'20px\',\\n    alignItems: \'flex-start\'\\n}}>\\n    <img \\n        src={require(\'./img/TemePark_00.png\').default} \\n        alt=\\"theme_park 1\\" \\n        style={{ \\n            width: \'calc(33.33% - 10px)\',\\n            objectFit: \'contain\',\\n            aspectRatio: \'auto\'\\n        }} \\n    />\\n    <img \\n        src={require(\'./img/TemePark_01.png\').default} \\n        alt=\\"theme_park 2\\" \\n        style={{ \\n            width: \'calc(54.5% - 10px)\',\\n            objectFit: \'contain\',\\n            aspectRatio: \'auto\'\\n        }} \\n    />\\n   \\n</div>\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Why Build with UModeler X?  \\nGame development is all about speed and creativity. With **Theme Park + UModeler X**:  \\n- Turn an idea into a playable scene in no time  \\n- Edit and customize everything directly in the Unity Editor  \\n- Apply it across hyper-casual, VR/AR, and even educational projects  \\n\\nNo more waiting on asset revisions or external tools \u2014 you can go straight from concept to prototype.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Requirements  \\n- Unity 6000.0.36f1 or higher  \\n- URP / Built-in supported (HDRP convertible)  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Try It Now \ud83d\ude80  \\n\\n<div style={{ display: \\"flex\\", flexWrap: \\"wrap\\", gap: \\"20px\\", marginTop: \\"20px\\" }}>\\n  <div style={{ flex: 1, minWidth: \\"200px\\", textAlign: \\"center\\", border: \\"1px solid #eaeaea\\", borderRadius: \\"12px\\", padding: \\"20px\\" }}>\\n    <h3>Discord</h3>\\n    <p>Join the official UModeler community</p>\\n    <a href=\\"https://discord.com/invite/jvZmTkKbfF\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style={{ display: \\"inline-block\\", background: \\"#6c5ce7\\", color: \\"#fff\\", padding: \\"10px 20px\\", borderRadius: \\"8px\\", textDecoration: \\"none\\" }}>Go \u2197</a>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style={{ flex: 1, minWidth: \\"200px\\", textAlign: \\"center\\", border: \\"1px solid #eaeaea\\", borderRadius: \\"12px\\", padding: \\"20px\\" }}>\\n    <h3>Asset Store</h3>\\n    <p>Check out Theme Park on the Unity Asset Store</p>\\n    <a href=\\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/theme-park-umodeler-x-330120\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style={{ display: \\"inline-block\\", background: \\"#6c5ce7\\", color: \\"#fff\\", padding: \\"10px 20px\\", borderRadius: \\"8px\\", textDecoration: \\"none\\" }}>Go \u2197</a>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style={{ flex: 1, minWidth: \\"200px\\", textAlign: \\"center\\", border: \\"1px solid #eaeaea\\", borderRadius: \\"12px\\", padding: \\"20px\\" }}>\\n    <h3>Homepage</h3>\\n    <p>Visit the official UModeler X website</p>\\n    <a href=\\"https://unity.umodeler.com/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style={{ display: \\"inline-block\\", background: \\"#6c5ce7\\", color: \\"#fff\\", padding: \\"10px 20px\\", borderRadius: \\"8px\\", textDecoration: \\"none\\" }}>Go \u2197</a>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style={{ flex: 1, minWidth: \\"200px\\", textAlign: \\"center\\", border: \\"1px solid #eaeaea\\", borderRadius: \\"12px\\", padding: \\"20px\\" }}>\\n    <h3>Tamplate</h3>\\n    <p>See All Templates</p>\\n    <a href=\\"https://docs.umodeler.com/umodeler-x-template/\\" style={{ display: \\"inline-block\\", background: \\"#6c5ce7\\", color: \\"#fff\\", padding: \\"10px 20px\\", borderRadius: \\"8px\\", textDecoration: \\"none\\" }}>Go \u2197</a>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Internal Links \\n- [UModeler X \ud29c\ud1a0\ub9ac\uc5bc \ubaa8\uc74c](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/intro/)   \\n- [Unity Asset Store UModeler \ud65c\uc6a9 \uc0ac\ub840](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/zepeto-item-guidebook-UV-and-Texturing)"},{"id":"new-available-SeaOtterChef","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/new-available-SeaOtterChef","source":"@site/blog/2025-9-02/2025-9-02.md","title":"New Asset Update for Hyper-Casual Game Creators: Introducing Sea Otter Chef!","description":"New Asset Update for Hyper-Casual Game Creators: Introducing Sea Otter Chef!","date":"2025-09-02T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"September 2, 2025","tags":[{"label":"UModelerX","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x"},{"label":"UModeler X Pro","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-pro"},{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"IndieDev","permalink":"/blog/tags/indie-dev"},{"label":"Interview","permalink":"/blog/tags/interview"},{"label":"Stylized","permalink":"/blog/tags/stylized"},{"label":"Casual Game","permalink":"/blog/tags/casual-game"},{"label":"Asset Pack","permalink":"/blog/tags/asset-pack"}],"readingTime":2.265,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"Sora Chae","title":"Marketing Manager","email":"sora.c@umodeler.com","key":"sora"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"New Asset Update for Hyper-Casual Game Creators: Introducing Sea Otter Chef!","description":"New Asset Update for Hyper-Casual Game Creators: Introducing Sea Otter Chef!","slug":"new-available-SeaOtterChef","authors":["sora"],"tags":["UModelerX","UModeler X Pro","Unity","IndieDev","Interview","Stylized","Casual Game","Asset Pack"],"date":"2025-09-02","image":"/img/SeaOtterChef_card_420x280.png"},"prevItem":{"title":"Famous Theme Park Game Success Stories & Unity Asset | UModeler X","permalink":"/blog/theme-park-success"},"nextItem":{"title":"Now Available: NeoFactory, Unity Digital Twin 3D Asset Pack","permalink":"/blog/new-available-neofactory"}},"content":"![](./img/SeaOtterChef_media_1200x630.png)\\n\\n---\\n\\nHello from UModeler X! \ud83c\udfae\\n\\nOver the past year, we\u2019ve been preparing a stylized asset template library designed to make development smoother and faster for indie developers and hyper-casual game creators. And this month, we\u2019re excited to unveil the very first release in this series: **Sea Otter Chef**! \ud83e\udda6\\n\\n**\ud83d\udc49 Experience the *Sea Otter Chef* Beach Village Demo directly inside Unity.**\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n  <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2oq4s_jjVqs?si=GlvLAl8CQhbs0yuH\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n---\\n\\n## More Than Just an Asset Pack\\n\\n*Sea Otter Chef* goes beyond being a simple stylized environment pack. It\u2019s a template-based library built to be used right away in hyper-casual and casual adventure game projects.\\n\\nHere\u2019s what\u2019s included:\\n\\n- \ud83e\udda6 **Adorable Sea Otter Chef Character**: Add charm with a unique main character.\\n- \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f **Beach Village Objects**: Houses, shops, palm trees, parasols, and more to set the scene.\\n- \ud83c\udf64 **Cooking-Themed Props**: Cute kitchen items to enrich storytelling and interactivity.\\n\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Optimized for Unity & UModeler X\\n\\nSeamlessly compatible with both Unity and UModeler X, *Sea Otter Chef* allows you to freely edit meshes, recolor assets, and adjust UVs\u2014directly inside the Unity Editor.\\n\\nWith **UModeler X Pro**, you can move from concept to a playable scene in no time. Since speed is crucial in hyper-casual development, this template gives you the power to prototype instantly and keep your workflow efficient.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## A Roadmap of Continuous Updates\\n\\n*Sea Otter Chef* is just the beginning. We\u2019re planning to expand this template library with more themed environments such as fantasy villages, forest towns, and beyond.\\n\\nBy using these templates, developers won\u2019t just be buying assets\u2014they\u2019ll be adopting ready-to-use solutions that shorten workflows and let them focus on what matters most: building great games.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Key Features\\n\\n- \ud83e\udda6 **Charming Character**: A lovable otter chef to bring life to your project.\\n- \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f **Stylized Beach Environment**: Complete with buildings, props, and tropical details.\\n- \ud83c\udf64 **Cooking-Themed Items**: Props that enable fun, interactive storytelling.\\n- \ud83c\udfae **Full UModeler X Integration**: Mesh editing, UV adjustments, recoloring, and more.\\n- \ud83c\udf10 **Versatile Use Cases**: Perfect for hyper-casual games, VR/AR experiences, simulations, and more.\\n\\n![](./img/SOC_all_002.png)\\n![](./img/SOC_all_003.png)\\n![](./img/SOC_all_004.png)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Specs**\\n\\n- Unity 2020.3 or newer\\n- URP supported (HDRP conversion possible)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Get Started Now**\\n\\nCheck out the links below to learn more and start creating with Sea Otter Chef:\\n- \ud83d\udd17 [UModeler X Official Website](https://unity.umodeler.com/)\\n- \ud83d\uded2 [Check out Sea Otter Chef on the Unity Asset Store](https://assetstore.unity.com/)\\n- \ud83d\udcac [Join the UModeler Discord](https://discord.com/invite/jvZmTkKbfF)\\n\\nKick off your creative hyper-casual game projects with UModeler X and Sea Otter Chef!\\nWe\u2019re here to support your journey every step of the way. \ud83d\ude80\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Internal Links\\n\\n- [UModeler X Tutorial Collection](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/intro/)  \\n- [Unity Asset Store: UModeler Use Cases](https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/fishing-island-umodeler-x-326744)"},{"id":"new-available-neofactory","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/new-available-neofactory","source":"@site/blog/2025-8-26/2025-8-26.md","title":"Now Available: NeoFactory, Unity Digital Twin 3D Asset Pack","description":"Now Available: NeoFactory, Unity Digital Twin 3D Asset Pack","date":"2025-08-26T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"August 26, 2025","tags":[{"label":"UModelerX","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x"},{"label":"UModeler X Pro","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-pro"},{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"IndieDev","permalink":"/blog/tags/indie-dev"},{"label":"Interview","permalink":"/blog/tags/interview"},{"label":"WannaBePro","permalink":"/blog/tags/wanna-be-pro"},{"label":"Industry","permalink":"/blog/tags/industry"}],"readingTime":1.88,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"Sora Chae","title":"Marketing Manager","email":"sora.c@umodeler.com","key":"sora"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Now Available: NeoFactory, Unity Digital Twin 3D Asset Pack","description":"Now Available: NeoFactory, Unity Digital Twin 3D Asset Pack","slug":"new-available-neofactory","authors":["sora"],"tags":["UModelerX","UModeler X Pro","Unity","IndieDev","Interview","WannaBePro","Industry"],"date":"2025-08-26","image":"/img/NeoFactory_1.png"},"prevItem":{"title":"New Asset Update for Hyper-Casual Game Creators: Introducing Sea Otter Chef!","permalink":"/blog/new-available-SeaOtterChef"},"nextItem":{"title":"[Wanna be Pro Winner Interview] InoXtiC, Behind the Scenes of \'TreeHouse\'","permalink":"/blog/wanna-be-pro-inoxic-treehouse"}},"content":"![](<./img/Neo Factory_5.png>)\\n\\n\\n\\nOver the past year, we\u2019ve been building **digital twin environment assets** that work seamlessly in both game and industrial contexts with **UModeler X Unity**.\\n\\nThis month, we\u2019re thrilled to release the first milestone of that effort \u2014 **NeoFactory**! \ud83c\udf89\\n\\n\ud83d\udc49 Check out the **simulation demo** running inside Unity below.\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n  <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xzkgUKf6yY4\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n## Why NeoFactory?\\n\\nNeoFactory isn\u2019t just another **stylized 3D factory pack**.\\n\\nIt opens a streamlined way to build **industrial workflows and simulation prototypes** quickly and reliably.\\n\\n- \u2705 **Modular industrial assets**: factory buildings, machinery, conveyors, pipelines, industrial props  \\n- \u2705 **Neon cyberpunk aesthetic**: futuristic visuals blended with realistic industrial design  \\n- \u2705 **Full Unity & UModeler X compatibility**: edit assets directly inside Unity for rapid iteration  \\n\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Workflow for Industry & Simulation\\n\\nWe go beyond game-ready assets to help teams build **digital twin prototypes** fast.\\n\\nWe\u2019re currently developing a **demo simulation aligned with Korean civil engineering scenarios** \u2014 leveraging Unity and NeoFactory for **roads, bridges, and industrial complexes** to create presentation-ready, realistic environments.\\n\\nPlanned expansions include smart factories, logistics warehouses, energy plants, production lines, ports, and more.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Roadmap\\n\\nNeoFactory is just the beginning.\\nFor **UModeler X Pro** customers, we plan to **ship additional industrial digital twin packs as ready-to-use templates**.\\nThis will enable **faster prototyping** and **more efficient workflows** for real industrial projects as well as games.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Key Features\\n\\n- \ud83c\udfed **Digital twin industrial environment** \u2013 production modules, machines, conveyors, racks/pipes, process props  \\n- \ud83d\udca1 **Neo industrial mood** \u2013 distinctive lighting and details  \\n- \u2699\ufe0f **Modular structure** \u2013 mix & match buildings, machines, and facilities  \\n- \ud83c\udfae **UModeler X compatibility** \u2013 edit/remesh/UV/recolor directly in the editor  \\n- \ud83c\udf10 **Versatile uses** \u2013 games, VR/AR, metaverse, **digital twin simulations**\\n\\n\\n![](<./img/Neo Factory_2.png>)\\n![](<./img/Neo Factory_3.png>)\\n![](<./img/Neo Factory_4.png>)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Specifications**\\n\\n- **Unity 2020.3 or higher**\\n- **Supports URP**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Get Started Now**\\n\\n- \ud83d\udd17 [UModeler X Official Website](https://unity.umodeler.com/)\\n- \ud83d\uded2 [Check out Neo Factory on the Unity Asset Store](https://assetstore.unity.com/)\\n- \ud83d\udcac [Join the UModeler Discord](https://discord.com/invite/jvZmTkKbfF)\\n\\n**Experience new possibilities in both industrial environments and game worlds with UModeler X and Neo Factory.**  \\nWe look forward to seeing your creative simulation projects.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Internal Links\\n\\n- [UModeler X Tutorial Collection](#) \\n- [Unity Asset Store: UModeler Use Cases](#)"},{"id":"wanna-be-pro-inoxic-treehouse","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/wanna-be-pro-inoxic-treehouse","source":"@site/blog/2025-8-21/2025-8-21.md","title":"[Wanna be Pro Winner Interview] InoXtiC, Behind the Scenes of \'TreeHouse\'","description":"Wanna be Pro winner InoXtiC shares the making of \'TreeHouse\' and their experience with UModeler X Pro.","date":"2025-08-21T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"August 21, 2025","tags":[{"label":"UModelerX","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x"},{"label":"UModeler X Pro","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-pro"},{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"IndieDev","permalink":"/blog/tags/indie-dev"},{"label":"Interview","permalink":"/blog/tags/interview"},{"label":"WannaBePro","permalink":"/blog/tags/wanna-be-pro"}],"readingTime":4.445,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"Sora Chae","title":"Marketing Manager","email":"sora.c@umodeler.com","key":"sora"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"[Wanna be Pro Winner Interview] InoXtiC, Behind the Scenes of \'TreeHouse\'","description":"Wanna be Pro winner InoXtiC shares the making of \'TreeHouse\' and their experience with UModeler X Pro.","slug":"wanna-be-pro-inoxic-treehouse","authors":["sora"],"tags":["UModelerX","UModeler X Pro","Unity","IndieDev","Interview","WannaBePro"],"date":"2025-08-21","image":"./img/inoxic-treehouse-cover.webp"},"prevItem":{"title":"Now Available: NeoFactory, Unity Digital Twin 3D Asset Pack","permalink":"/blog/new-available-neofactory"},"nextItem":{"title":"UModeler X Pro Personal - Unity 3D Modeling for Indie Creators","permalink":"/blog/propersonal-license-2025"}},"content":"![](./img/inoxic-treehouse-cover.webp)\\nThe **Wanna Be Pro** campaign showcases Unity creators who turn ideas into polished scenes using **UModeler X Pro**.  \\nFrom this pool, we selected works that paired technical quality with a unique story and dedication. One standout is **InoXtiC\u2019s \u201cTreeHouse\u201d**\u2014a fan-made recreation built in UModeler X for Unity that highlights time-saving in-editor modeling, UV, and painting.  \\n*(For readers exploring tools, see our upcoming guides on UModeler tutorial topics and comparisons like **UModeler vs Blender**.)*\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Wanna be Pro** winner **InoXtiC** shares the story behind creating **\u201cTreeHouse\u201d**, inspired by Hololive\u2019s **Mumei Treehouse**.  \\nIn this interview, InoXtiC talks about how Unity\u2019s all-in-one environment (modeling \xb7 UV \xb7 painting) helped shorten development time, how beginners can adapt quickly, and the pros and cons of a real-time workflow.  \\n\\n> \u201cWith UModeler X Pro, I was able to handle modeling, UV editing, and painting entirely inside Unity \u2014 no external tools were required. That seamless workflow saved me significant time.\u201d \u2014 *InoXtiC*\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Introduction\\n\\n**Q. Could you please introduce yourself briefly?**  \\nA. My name is **InoXtiC**. I am a Virtual World Creator and a 3D environment artist.  \\nI enjoy recreating anime-inspired spaces and experimenting with sci-fi mechanical designs using Unity and Blender. I have also created worlds for VRChat, a platform where people gather to socialize and communicate.\\n\\nBeyond \u201cTreeHouse,\u201d I have worked on a variety of projects, such as:  \\n- Cozy character-themed bedrooms  \\n- Detailed mechanical assets  \\nThese works demonstrate my versatility in both environment design and hard-surface modeling.  \\n\\n**Portfolio Highlights**  \\n![](./img/inoxic-portfolio.webp)\\n\\n\u2726 [Follow me on Discord](https://discord.com/invite/NrWQMqF)  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Development Process\\n\\n**Q. How long did this project take?**  \\nA. The entire process took approximately 5 weeks.  \\n\\n**Q. Could you walk us through your overall workflow?**  \\nA. The workflow followed this sequence: Idea \u2192 Modeling (blockout) \u2192 Texturing \u2192 Adjustments (if needed) \u2192 Lighting \u2192 Final Render.  \\n\\n**Q. What advantages did you find working directly inside Unity?**  \\nA.  \\n- I was able to edit models and immediately test them in-scene with lighting and camera, which greatly accelerated iteration speed.  \\n- Level and game designers could build prototypes on their own and apply gameplay feedback within the same day.  \\n- Because there was no need for repeated export/import cycles, the cost of context switching was effectively eliminated.  \\n\\n**Q. What was the biggest challenge and how did you overcome it?**  \\nA. UV editing was the most challenging aspect. At times, the process was confusing, but by progressing step by step \u2014 even in small increments \u2014 I was able to maintain momentum and achieve steady progress.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Highlights of \u201cTreeHouse\u201d\\n![](./img/inoxic-showcase.webp)  \\n![](./img/inoxic-showcase2.webp)\\n\\n**Q. What makes this work unique?**  \\nA.  \\n- I aimed to recreate the Mumei Treehouse as close to 1:1 as possible, paying attention to textures, placements, and proportions.  \\n- Although I began with only reference screenshots and no blueprints, I refined the work daily until it closely matched the actual showcase.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Experience with UModeler X Pro\\n\\n**Q. What are the biggest advantages of UModeler X Pro?**  \\nA.  \\n- **Time saving**: Modeling, UV editing, and painting are all integrated inside Unity, ensuring uninterrupted workflow.  \\n- **Ease of use**: Compared to complex DCC tools, the learning curve is significantly lower, enabling beginners to adapt quickly.  \\n- **Real-time workflow**: Edits can be made and tested instantly with lighting, camera, or collision in full context.  \\n- **Key features**: Radial Spinning and **Rotate/Align to Face** considerably improved placement efficiency.  \\n- **Clean UI**: The organized interface supported focus and workflow continuity.  \\n\\n**Q. What improvements would you like to see?**  \\nA.  \\n- More intuitive **rotation and alignment UX** across objects.  \\n- Enhanced **snapping visibility and accuracy**.  \\n- Greater precision for **fine UV scale adjustments**.  \\n- Clearer selection feedback and improved stability for **Loop/Loop Cut** operations.  \\n- The ability to change hotkeys directly via the right-click menu.  \\n\\n**Q. Did you use any other tools along with UModeler?**  \\nA. Yes. I occasionally relied on Blender for elements that were either too complex or time-consuming to complete solely with UModeler.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Why UModeler X Pro?\\n\\n**Q. Why did you choose UModeler X Pro over other tools?**  \\nA.  \\n- The ability to complete modeling, UV editing, and painting entirely within Unity eliminated resource exchange and format conversion issues.  \\n- Artists, designers, and planners could collaborate in the same scene, allowing faster decision-making.  \\n- \u201cWhat you see is what you play\u201d \u2014 balance, flow, and visibility could be tested immediately.  \\n- Initial blockouts evolved seamlessly into production assets, minimizing pipeline inefficiencies.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Messages\\n\\n**Q. Do you have any feedback for the UModeler team?**  \\nA. I would recommend improving Loop/Loop Cut interaction feedback, enhancing snapping accuracy, and adding the ability to edit hotkeys directly via right-click.  \\n\\n**Q. Any advice for beginners, students, or indie developers?**  \\nA.  \\n- UModeler X allows you to create objects faster and more reliably than ProBuilder, with a cleaner UI.  \\n- While the workflow may feel confusing at first, there are cases where UModeler X proves even faster than Blender.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Closing\\n\\nWe sincerely thank **InoXtiC** for sharing their insights.  \\nThis interview will be featured on the **UModeler official blog** and shared across Discord and community channels to inspire more creators.  \\n\\n\ud83d\udc49 [Learn more about UModeler X Pro](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/intro/)  \\n\ud83d\udc49 [UV Fine-Tuning Tips](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/zepeto-item-guidebook-UV-and-Texturing)  \\n\\n\ud83d\udcac **What do you think?**  \\nShare your thoughts on the creation process or your own experience with UModeler X Pro in our [Discord community](https://discord.com/invite/jvZmTkKbfF)!"},{"id":"propersonal-license-2025","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/propersonal-license-2025","source":"@site/blog/2025-8-5/2025-8-5.md","title":"UModeler X Pro Personal - Unity 3D Modeling for Indie Creators","description":"Meet the new UModeler X Personal License! Designed for solo creators, students, and hobbyists","date":"2025-08-05T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"August 5, 2025","tags":[{"label":"UModelerX","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x"},{"label":"PropersonalLicense","permalink":"/blog/tags/propersonal-license"},{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"IndieDev","permalink":"/blog/tags/indie-dev"},{"label":"3DModeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/3-d-modeling"},{"label":"Launch","permalink":"/blog/tags/launch"},{"label":"ProLicense","permalink":"/blog/tags/pro-license"},{"label":"Discount","permalink":"/blog/tags/discount"}],"readingTime":2.69,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Sora Chae","title":"Marketing Manager","email":"sora.c@umodeler.com","key":"sora"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"UModeler X Pro Personal - Unity 3D Modeling for Indie Creators","description":"Meet the new UModeler X Personal License! Designed for solo creators, students, and hobbyists","slug":"propersonal-license-2025","authors":"sora","tags":["UModelerX","PropersonalLicense","Unity","IndieDev","3DModeling","Launch","ProLicense","Discount"],"date":"2025-08-05T00:00:00.000Z","image":"./img/umodeler-personal-launch-2025.webp"},"prevItem":{"title":"[Wanna be Pro Winner Interview] InoXtiC, Behind the Scenes of \'TreeHouse\'","permalink":"/blog/wanna-be-pro-inoxic-treehouse"},"nextItem":{"title":"2025 Unity Asset Store Summer Sale","permalink":"/blog/summer-sale-2025"}},"content":"![](./img/umodeler-personal-launch-2025.webp)\\n\\n# UModeler X Pro Personal License Release!\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n**We\u2019re thrilled to introduce the UModeler X Pro Personal License \u2013 launching August 5!**  \\nThe UModeler X Pro Personal License officially launched on August 5!\\nWhether you\'re a solo developer, student, or creative hobbyist, you can now access all the essential 3D editing features of UModeler X for just USD9/month.\\nUpgrade your Unity workflow at an affordable price with the power of UModeler X.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udca1 What is UModeler X Pro Personal License?\\n\\nFor months, UModeler X has been available under our Pro and Enterprise tiers \u2013 supporting professional teams with a full suite of modeling, rigging, and painting tools inside Unity.\\n\\nBut we\u2019ve heard you \u2013 many creators want access to the same power and workflow at a more accessible price.\\n\\n## Key Features of the Pro Personal Plan\\n**So here it is: UModeler X Pro Personal License.**\\n\\n- \u2705 Full access to 3D editing tools  \\n- \u2705 Ongoing feature updates  \\n- \u2705 Early access to new tools  \\n- \u2705 PFL (Perpetual Fallback License) included  \\n- \u2705 Usage limited only by scale \u2013 not by creativity  \\n\\n:::caution \ud83d\udcac Usage Eligibility\\nThe Pro Personal License is only available to individuals or teams whose **total revenue or funding was under $200,000 USD in the past 12 months.**  \\nIf your organization exceeds this threshold, we recommend the Pro or Enterprise plans instead.\\n:::\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Pro Personal vs Pro vs Plus \u2013 What\u2019s the Difference?\\n\\n![License Comparison Animation](./img/umodeler-license-comparison-v2.gif)\\n\\n\\n\ud83d\udccc **See full license pricing and feature comparison:**  \\n\ud83d\udc49 [Go to Pricing Page](https://unity.umodeler.com/Price)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83c\udfaf Who Is It For?\\n\\n- **Pro Personal** \u2013 Solo creators, students, or indie developers with limited budgets  \\n- **Pro** \u2013 Indie dev teams or studios looking for more content  \\n- **Enterprise** \u2013 Full teams, universities, or production studios with complex needs\\n\\n> \ud83d\udc49 *Remember: Pro Personal License is only available to users or teams with < $200K revenue/funding in the past 12 months.*\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83c\udf81 Special Upgrade Offers for Existing UModeler Users\\n\\nWe\u2019re offering **exclusive upgrade benefits** for our loyal users:\\n\\n### \ud83c\udd93 UModeler X Plus Users (from Unity Asset Store)\\n\\n- **1-year Personal License \u2014 FREE**  \\n- This effectively grants you a **Perpetual Fallback License (PFL)** right away \u2014 no subscription required.\\n\\n### \ud83d\udcb8 UModeler (Legacy) Users\\n\\n- **30% OFF** your first-year Personal subscription  \\n- Maintain your subscription for one year to receive a **PFL (permanent license)** at the end.\\n\\n\\n## \ud83d\udce9 How to Upgrade to UModeler X Pro Personal\\n\\n\\nGo to our [Pricing Page](https://unity.umodeler.com/Price) and choose either the **Pro Personal** or **Pro** plan.  \\nA field will appear where you can **enter your Unity Asset Store invoice number** to apply your discount.\\n\\n![How to enter your invoice](./img/invoice-submit-guide.png)\\n\\n<div style={{ display: \'flex\', justifyContent: \'center\', marginTop: \'1rem\' }}>\\n  <a\\n    href=\\"https://unity.umodeler.com/Price\\"\\n    target=\\"_blank\\"\\n    style={{\\n      display: \'inline-block\',\\n      backgroundColor: \'#007BFF\',\\n      color: \'#fff\',\\n      padding: \'0.75rem 1.5rem\',\\n      textDecoration: \'none\',\\n      borderRadius: \'6px\',\\n      fontWeight: \'bold\',\\n      fontSize: \'1rem\'\\n    }}\\n  >\\n    Go to Pricing Page\\n  </a>\\n</div>\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udce2 Join the UModeler Community\\n[\ud83d\udcac Join our official Discord](https://discord.gg/tc4cRXKf) to get the latest updates, perks, and support.\\n\\n---\\n## Start Creating with UModeler X Personal Today\\n> **Start your 3D journey today with the new UModeler X Personal License.**  \\n> Full Editor. Fair Price!"},{"id":"summer-sale-2025","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/summer-sale-2025","source":"@site/blog/2025-7-17/2025-7-17.md","title":"2025 Unity Asset Store Summer Sale","description":"Kick off the summer with up to 50% off! The Unity Asset Store Summer Sale is here \u2014 enjoy 50% off UModeler X Plus and get exclusive gifts just for joining.","date":"2025-07-17T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"July 17, 2025","tags":[{"label":"UModelerXPlus","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-plus"},{"label":"UModelerXPro","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-pro"},{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"3DModeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/3-d-modeling"},{"label":"Asset","permalink":"/blog/tags/asset"},{"label":"License","permalink":"/blog/tags/license"},{"label":"SummerSale","permalink":"/blog/tags/summer-sale"},{"label":"UnityAssetStore","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity-asset-store"},{"label":"Promotion","permalink":"/blog/tags/promotion"}],"readingTime":1.705,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Sora Chae","title":"Marketing Manager","email":"sora.c@umodeler.com","key":"sora"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"2025 Unity Asset Store Summer Sale","description":"Kick off the summer with up to 50% off! The Unity Asset Store Summer Sale is here \u2014 enjoy 50% off UModeler X Plus and get exclusive gifts just for joining.","slug":"summer-sale-2025","authors":"sora","tags":["UModelerXPlus","UModelerXPro","Unity","3DModeling","Asset","License","SummerSale","UnityAssetStore","Promotion"],"date":"2025-07-17T00:00:00.000Z","image":"./img/umodeler-summer-sale-2025.png"},"prevItem":{"title":"UModeler X Pro Personal - Unity 3D Modeling for Indie Creators","permalink":"/blog/propersonal-license-2025"},"nextItem":{"title":"2025 Unity Asset Store Spring Sale","permalink":"/blog/spring-sale-2025"}},"content":"![](./img/umodeler-summer-sale-2025.png)\\n\\n# \u2600\ufe0f 2025 Unity Asset Store Summer is here!\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nFrom **July 16 to August 27**, grab **UModeler X Plus** at a special discounted price!\\n\\nLooking to stay productive during your summer break?  \\nNow is the perfect time to **own a powerful 3D modeling tool** at a truly affordable price.\\n\\nCheck out the discount details below \ud83d\udc47\\n\\n\\n\\n| Feature | **UModeler** | **UModeler X Plus**  |\\n|--------|--------------|-----------------------------------------------|\\n| **Price** | $125 (Unity Asset Store) | ~$199 \u2192 **$99.50**<br />_(50% off)_ |\\n| **Technical Support** | \u2705 | \u2705 |\\n| **Core 3D Editor** | \u2705 Low-poly only | \u2705 Low-poly + High-poly support |\\n| **External Asset Compatibility**<br />(e.g. Synty modification) | \u2705 | \u2705  |\\n| **Rigging Tools** | \u274c | \u2705 |\\n| **Painting Tools** | \u274c | \u2705 |\\n| **License Type** | Lifetime License | Lifetime License |\\n| **Asset Store Link** | [\ud83d\udc49 UModeler ](https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-80868) | [\ud83d\udc49 UModeler X Plus ](https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-x-plus-288107) |\\n\\n\\n---\\n\\n:::tip \ud83c\udf89 Try UModeler X for Free!\\nYou can now try UModeler X Pro for 45 days FREE from our [official website](https://umodeler.com) \u2014 no credit card required.\\n\\n\ud83d\udcac **Plus user?** Leave a review after your purchase and receive a 3-month UModeler X Pro subscription as a thank-you gift!\\n:::\\n\\n## \ud83d\ude80 UModeler X Plus \u2013 Review Bonus\\n\\n### \ud83c\udf81 Bonus for UModeler X Plus Users\\n\\n![](./img/umodeler-summer-sale-2025_2.png)\\n\\nIf you purchased **UModeler X Plus**, you can leave a review and receive a **3-month UModeler X Pro subscription \u2014 completely free**!\\n\\n\\n### \ud83c\udfae Win a $10 Steam Gift Card\\n\\nWe\u2019ll randomly select **5 verified customers** to win a **$10 Steam card** \u2014 perfect for grabbing your next favorite game or creative tool!\\n\\n\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f **Winners will be announced on August 30th via our official Discord.**\\n\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83c\udfd6 Don\u2019t Miss Out This Summer!\\n\\nEven during your vacation, you can stay productive with the **ultimate modeling toolset**.\\n\\nTake advantage of the **special summer discounts** and get access to **UModeler products at unbeatable prices**.\\n\\n> **Now is the perfect time to kickstart your 3D modeling journey!**"},{"id":"spring-sale-2025","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/spring-sale-2025","source":"@site/blog/2025-4-19/2025-4-19.md","title":"2025 Unity Asset Store Spring Sale","description":"Don\'t miss out on up to 70% off UModeler X Plus, UModeler, and the Pro upgrade!","date":"2025-04-19T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"April 19, 2025","tags":[{"label":"UModeler","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler"},{"label":"UModelerX","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x"},{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"3DModeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/3-d-modeling"},{"label":"Asset","permalink":"/blog/tags/asset"},{"label":"License","permalink":"/blog/tags/license"},{"label":"Update","permalink":"/blog/tags/update"},{"label":"3dsMax","permalink":"/blog/tags/3-ds-max"},{"label":"Maya","permalink":"/blog/tags/maya"},{"label":"Photoshop","permalink":"/blog/tags/photoshop"},{"label":"SpringSale","permalink":"/blog/tags/spring-sale"},{"label":"UnityAssetStore","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity-asset-store"}],"readingTime":1.205,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"2025 Unity Asset Store Spring Sale","description":"Don\'t miss out on up to 70% off UModeler X Plus, UModeler, and the Pro upgrade!","slug":"spring-sale-2025","authors":"jaesik","tags":["UModeler","UModelerX","Unity","3DModeling","Asset","License","Update","3dsMax","Maya","Photoshop","SpringSale","UnityAssetStore"],"date":"2025-04-19T00:00:00.000Z","image":"./img/umodeler-spring-sale-2025.webp"},"prevItem":{"title":"2025 Unity Asset Store Summer Sale","permalink":"/blog/summer-sale-2025"},"nextItem":{"title":"UModeler X Pro Release and Q1 2025 Update","permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-pro-q1-2025-update"}},"content":"![](./img/umodeler-spring-sale-2025.webp)\\n\\n# \ud83c\udf38 The 2025 Unity Asset Store Spring Sale Has Begun!\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nDuring this **Spring Sale running until May 8**, grab **UModeler X Plus** and **UModeler** at **discounted prices**.\\n\\nWith just a one-time purchase, you can **own a powerful 3D modeling tool forever**.\\n\\nCheck the table below for detailed discount information.  \\n\\n|  | **UModeler X Plus** | **UModeler** |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| **Discount Rate** | **50%** | **70% (Apr 18)** \u2192 **60% (Apr 19)** \u2192 **50%** |\\n| **Features** | Upgraded UX/UI, high-poly modeling, SketchUp-style modeling, UV editing (including LSCM), rigging, painting | Low-poly modeling, SketchUp-style modeling, UV editing (LSCM not included) |\\n| **Asset Store Link** | [\ud83d\udc49 Go to UModeler X Plus](https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-x-plus-288107) | [\ud83d\udc49 Go to UModeler](https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-80868) |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Pro Version - Upgrade Discount Available\\n\\nIf you own **UModeler X Plus or UModeler**, you can upgrade to the **recently released UModeler X Pro (1-year subscription)** at **50% off**.\\n\\n**Exclusive Pro Features:**\\n\\n- Includes all features of UModeler X Plus  \\n- **High-quality 3D templates worth $700**  \\n- Curve Mesh Editor  \\n- Text Tool  \\n- Edge Constraint Tool  \\n- Quadify Tool  \\n- More advanced tools to be added continuously  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## \u23f0 Don\u2019t Miss This Opportunity!\\n\\nThis is a golden chance to get a powerful toolset at a **great price**\u2014perfect for developers, designers, and creators alike.\\n\\nIf you\u2019ve been needing a 3D modeling tool, **now is the best time to get started**."},{"id":"umodeler-x-pro-q1-2025-update","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-pro-q1-2025-update","source":"@site/blog/2025-3-29/2025-3-29.md","title":"UModeler X Pro Release and Q1 2025 Update","description":"Introducing the UModeler X Pro license, free School license, and the key updates made during the first quarter of 2025.","date":"2025-03-29T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"March 29, 2025","tags":[{"label":"UModeler","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler"},{"label":"UModelerX","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x"},{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"3DModeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/3-d-modeling"},{"label":"Asset","permalink":"/blog/tags/asset"},{"label":"License","permalink":"/blog/tags/license"},{"label":"Update","permalink":"/blog/tags/update"},{"label":"3dsMax","permalink":"/blog/tags/3-ds-max"},{"label":"Maya","permalink":"/blog/tags/maya"},{"label":"Photoshop","permalink":"/blog/tags/photoshop"}],"readingTime":5.21,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"UModeler X Pro Release and Q1 2025 Update","slug":"umodeler-x-pro-q1-2025-update","description":"Introducing the UModeler X Pro license, free School license, and the key updates made during the first quarter of 2025.","authors":"jaesik","tags":["UModeler","UModelerX","Unity","3DModeling","Asset","License","Update","3dsMax","Maya","Photoshop"],"hide_table_of_contents":false,"date":"2025-03-29T00:00:00.000Z","lastmod":"2025-03-29T00:00:00.000Z","image":"./img/umodeler-x-pro.webp"},"prevItem":{"title":"2025 Unity Asset Store Spring Sale","permalink":"/blog/spring-sale-2025"},"nextItem":{"title":"UModeler X 2025 New Year Update","permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-2025-jan-news"}},"content":"![](./img/umodeler-x-pro.webp)\\n\\n# UModeler X Pro Release and Q1 2025 Update\\n\\n**UModeler X**, the innovative 3D content creation tool for Unity, proudly introduces its **Pro License**. Equipped with powerful modeling features, advanced tools for professionals, and access to a premium 3D template library valued at over USD 700, the Pro license is designed to empower both individual creators and teams.\\n\\nThis blog post outlines the full details of the UModeler X Pro license, its pricing, direction for the existing Plus version, the free School license for educators and students, our release roadmap, evangelist activities, and a summary of the major updates completed during Q1 2025.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n---\\n\\n## UModeler X Pro License: Advanced Modeling for Professionals\\n\\n**UModeler X Pro** is a premium license crafted for advanced users and creative teams. It delivers both high efficiency and precision in modeling workflows.\\n\\n### Pricing\\n  - Monthly subscription: ~~USD 28/month~~ **USD 20/month**\\n  - Annual subscription: ~~USD 280/year~~ **USD 199/year**\\n  - Visit the [official UModeler website](https://unity.umodeler.com) for more details.\\n\\n### Features\\n  - Includes all features from UModeler X Plus\\n  - 1st wave of exclusive Pro features:\\n    - **[Curve Mesh Component](/docs/curve-mesh)**: For creating organic and curved 3d meshes\\n    - **Text Tool**: Generate 3D text meshes\\n    - **Quadify Tool**: Convert triangle-based meshes to quad-based meshes\\n    - **Edge Constraints**: Allow vertices or edges to move along connected edges while preserving the original shape\\n    - **Isolation Selection Tool**: Select specific areas easily\\n\\n### Continuous Feature Updates\\n  - Pro users will receive **regular updates with newly developed advanced features**, many of which are released in beta for early access.\\n\\n### USD 700 Worth of 3D Template Library Included\\n  - Unlimited access to premium 3D assets sold individually on the Unity Asset Store\\n  - All assets are provided as **UModeler X prefabs**, ready to be edited and used directly within Unity\\n  - Learn more on the [Template Page](/umodeler-x-template)\\n\\n![](./img/umodeler-x-template.png)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## UModeler X Plus License\\n\\n**UModeler X Plus** has been a robust modeling toolset used by many creators, offering a comprehensive feature set with long-term support.\\n\\n### Pricing\\n  - Lifetime license\\n  - For individuals and teams with an annual revenue under $200,000\\n  - Learn more at the [UModeler X Plus page on the Unity Asset Store](https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-x-plus-288107)\\n\\n### Key Features\\n  - Essential 3D Modeling tools\\n  - Modifiers\\n  - UV editor\\n  - Rigging tools\\n  - Hotspot texturing system\\n  - 2D/3D Painting\\n  - SketchUp-style modeling tools and more\\n\\n### Future Direction and Relationship with Pro\\nUModeler X Plus shares the same codebase as Pro.\\nIn other words, Pro is an extended version built on top of Plus \u2014 it includes all the features of Plus along with advanced capabilities.\\n\\n\u2705 All Plus features will continue to receive updates at the same pace and quality as Pro.\\n\\n\u2728 Plus will continue to serve as a comprehensive modeling solution focused on stability and long-term maintenance.\\n\\n\ud83d\udd01 Rather than adding new features, we will prioritize strengthening the stability and maintaining the functionality that has already been implemented.\\n\\nIf you\'re using Plus, rest assured \u2014 it will remain fully supported and your tools will continue to improve.\\n\\n## School License: Free for Students and Educators\\n\\nTo support creative education, UModeler X offers a **free School license** to students and educators around the world.\\n\\n### Eligibility\\n  - Students and faculty at elementary, middle, high schools, and universities\\n\\n### How to Apply\\n  - Sign up using your school domain email\\n  - Visit the [School License Application Page](https://unity.umodeler.com/School)\\n\\n### Conditions\\n  - For **non-commercial use only**, such as education, learning, and assignments\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udcc5 Release Roadmap\\n\\n| Date | Milestone |\\n|------|-----------|\\n| **2025.03.24** | Pro teaser site launch |\\n| **2025.03.31** | Free trial version of Pro released |\\n| **2025.04.07** | Official paid Pro license launch |\\n\\nTry out Pro with the free trial before committing to the full version!\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Evangelist: \'Indie Game Hustle\'\\n\\nYouTuber **\'Indie Game Hustle\'**, who has been creating **helpful tutorial content** using UModeler X, officially joined us as a **UModeler X Evangelist in February 2024**.\\n\\nHis tutorials are beginner-friendly yet packed with insights, bridging the gap between product features and real-world usage. He will continue to expand the community and offer useful resources going forward.\\n\\n- **Featured Tutorials**\\n    <div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n      <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ef8LtRDzEA0?si=D53umyFiTmBhwfvT\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n    </div><br />\\n    <div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n      <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CML_cMsUcIk?si=xwn-MIalyqJXyTt5\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n    </div>\\n\\n> \ud83d\udc49 [View the full playlist](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLKfydgNGUTp2pMPZosmOpSeuaQGi1dhfu)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Q1 2025 Update Highlights\\n\\nDuring the first quarter of 2025, UModeler X received **12 major updates (v1.0.8 ~ v1.0.19)**. Here are the highlights:\\n\\n### SketchUp-Style Modeling Improvements\\n\\n- **Parallel Tool**, **Arc Tool** added\\n- **XY-axis snapping** implemented in the Polyline Tool\\n- Over **90% feature parity achieved** compared to the classic UModeler\\n- SketchUp-style tools are now stable and ready for production use\\n\\n> [Learn more about SketchUp-style modeling](/docs/modeling-sketchup-style)  \\n> [Watch the Arc Tool demo](https://youtu.be/qPHEbqENA7g?si=Mpb7CUQjBAEENIhE)\\n\\n- **Group Filter** feature for precise painting control\\n- **Smoothing Sharp Edge** for cleaner and softer edge rendering\\n\\n### Favorites Tool Group\\n\\n- Organize your most-used tools into a personal favorites group\\n- Default setup includes SketchUp-style tools for beginner-friendly modeling\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QZqlJ1ubrmo?si=oOvROXMpUPQ7kVwl\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n### Beta Feature Tags\\n\\nThe green potion icon indicates that a tool is currently in beta.\\nBeta tools have completed internal implementation and basic testing, and are now available for public use. However, they may still require improvements in terms of stability and polish.\\nAs such, some features of these tools might not behave as expected.\\nCurrently, tools like the SketchUp-style modeling tools, the Pro Text Tool, and the Curve Mesh Editor are marked as beta. These tools are under active development and will continue to be refined until they are production-ready.\\n\\n![](./img/beta-tools.webp)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Website & Manual Updates\\n\\nAlongside the Pro launch, we\'ve redesigned our website and documentation for better usability.\\n\\n- **Official Website**  \\n  - [unity.umodeler.com](https://unity.umodeler.com)\\n\\n- **New Navigation Sections**\\n  - [Template Menu](/umodeler-x-template): Overview of all template assets\\n  - [Support Menu](/support): FAQs, troubleshooting, tips and more\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Final Words\\n\\n**UModeler X** continues its mission to make 3D content creation more accessible for solo creators and more powerful for professionals.\\n\\nWith the launch of Pro, ongoing updates, community engagement, and educational support, UModeler X is evolving into a comprehensive modeling solution for Unity.\\n\\nThank you for being on this journey with us.  \\nLet\'s keep building amazing things together!"},{"id":"umodeler-x-2025-jan-news","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-2025-jan-news","source":"@site/blog/2025-1-3/2024-1-3.md","title":"UModeler X 2025 New Year Update","description":"Start the new year with exciting updates to UModeler X Plus! Discover new features including improved toolbar settings, enhanced Mirror Object tool, automatic rigging structure setup, and Element ID Selector. Plus, join our special VRChat world design contest and check out our new asset releases in the Unity Asset Store.\\n","date":"2025-01-03T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"January 3, 2025","tags":[{"label":"UModeler X Plus","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-plus"},{"label":"Blender","permalink":"/blog/tags/blender"},{"label":"3ds Max","permalink":"/blog/tags/3-ds-max"},{"label":"Maya","permalink":"/blog/tags/maya"},{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"Unity Editor Tools","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity-editor-tools"},{"label":"3D Modeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/3-d-modeling"},{"label":"VRChat","permalink":"/blog/tags/vr-chat"},{"label":"Design Contest","permalink":"/blog/tags/design-contest"},{"label":"New Features","permalink":"/blog/tags/new-features"},{"label":"Unity Asset Store","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity-asset-store"},{"label":"Mirror Tool","permalink":"/blog/tags/mirror-tool"},{"label":"Rigging Tools","permalink":"/blog/tags/rigging-tools"},{"label":"Modeling Tools","permalink":"/blog/tags/modeling-tools"}],"readingTime":3.635,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"UModeler X 2025 New Year Update","slug":"umodeler-x-2025-jan-news","description":"Start the new year with exciting updates to UModeler X Plus! Discover new features including improved toolbar settings, enhanced Mirror Object tool, automatic rigging structure setup, and Element ID Selector. Plus, join our special VRChat world design contest and check out our new asset releases in the Unity Asset Store.\\n","authors":"jaesik","tags":["UModeler X Plus","Blender","3ds Max","Maya","Unity","Unity Editor Tools","3D Modeling","VRChat","Design Contest","New Features","Unity Asset Store","Mirror Tool","Rigging Tools","Modeling Tools"],"hide_table_of_contents":false,"date":"2025-1-3","lastmod":"2025-1-3","image":"./img/umaker-design-contest-coverimg.png"},"prevItem":{"title":"UModeler X Pro Release and Q1 2025 Update","permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-pro-q1-2025-update"},"nextItem":{"title":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 Official Release & Holiday Sales Events Announcement - November 20, 2024","permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-plus-1-0-release-and-sales-events"}},"content":"![](./img/umaker-design-contest-coverimg.png)\\n\\nHello everyone!\\nWelcome to 2025! Today, we\'re excited to share the latest updates to UModeler X.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## Enhanced UModeler X Plus Features\\nThis update introduces several new features designed to boost your productivity. Notable additions to the Unity toolbar include two new popup windows: `UMX Display Settings` and `UMX Snap Settings`. These windows eliminate the need to navigate through Preferences\' options to adjust display and snap settings during your workflow!\\n![](./img/display-setting-snap-setting.png)\\n\\nFor those who love symmetrical modeling, we\'ve enhanced the `Mirror Object tool` with a preview feature that shows the mirrored parts before creation, making symmetrical modeling more intuitive and efficient.\\n![](./img/mirrorobject-preview.png)\\n\\nCharacter artists will appreciate our new `Create Root Bone Structure` feature, which automatically generates animation root bones and geometry object hierarchies for rigging. Say goodbye to complex manual setup before rigging!\\n![](./img/create-root-bone-structure.png)\\n\\nWe\'re also introducing the `Element ID Selector`, a powerful troubleshooting tool that visually displays IDs for vertices, edges, and faces, helping you quickly identify and resolve modeling issues.\\n<div class=\\"card\\">    \\n    <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Element ID Selector</h3>\\n    <a href=\\"/docs/menu-element-id-selector\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go to Documentation</a>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/M-WmnVcoDUQ?si=S41vT0SWzgH78aqb\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div> <br/>\\nRepetitive tasks just got easier with our new repeat function - simply press the `;` key to repeat your last action. This works with various tools including Bridge, Duplicate, Eraser, and Bevel.\\n<div class=\\"card\\">    \\n    <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Repeat Function</h3>\\n    <a href=\\"/docs/modeling-mode#repeat-tool\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go to Documentation</a>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oj-ug_H8GRc?si=0sb1lKYY0VSexN77\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div><br/>\\n\\nAdditionally, we\'ve renamed the `Line tool` to `Knife tool` and moved it to the `Add group`. The `Drawing mode` now features a new `Polyline tool`, which is continuously being improved!\\n\\n## Special Announcement for VRChat Users!\\nWe\'re launching an exciting VRChat world creation contest in collaboration with the Korean World Creators Hub and AbiFair! Create your unique VRChat world or object around the theme \\"Cozy Haven\\" for a chance to win a Meta Quest 3S! The contest runs from December 29, 2024, to January 29, 2025, with winners announced on February 5th. Find all the details at the link below:\\n![](./img/umake-contest.png)\\n<div class=\\"showcase-container\\">\\n   <div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n       <div class=\\"card\\">\\n           <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">UMake: VR Design Contest</h3>\\n           <p>Create a VRChat world and get a chance to win a Meta Quest 3S!</p>\\n           <a href=\\"https://sites.google.com/view/umakevr/en\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Apply Now</a>\\n       </div>\\n   </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n## One of the Top New Assets of 2024 \ud83c\udfc6\\nUModeler X Plus has been selected as one of the top assets of 2024 on the Unity Asset Store. With practical features that allow 3D modeling directly within Unity, it has gained popularity among many developers. If you\u2019re looking to enhance your workflow quickly and efficiently, check out UModeler X Plus.\\n![](./img/2024-top-assets.png)\\n\\n## User Showcase\\nWe\'re proud to highlight some amazing projects created with our tools. The third-person action platformer \'LUSTBORN\' has gained attention for its unique character and environment design.\\n\\n<div class=\\"showcase-container\\">\\n   <div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n       <div class=\\"card\\">                        \\n           <img src={require(\'./img/userwork-lustborn.png\').default} alt=\\"LUSTBORN\\"/>\\n           <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">LUSTBORN</h3>\\n           <p>Shoot, jump, and navigate your way through a twisted realm of lust and depravity in this third-person action platformer where you play as the buxom Mia Madden... the last LUSTBORN.</p>\\n           <a href=\\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3343320/Lustborn/\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Check in Steam</a>\\n       </div>\\n   </div>\\n</div>\\n\\nWe were also impressed by a user who recreated an Artstation artwork using our tool, showcasing the capabilities of UModeler X.\\n![](./img/umodeler-userwork1.png)\\n![](./img/umodeler-userwork2.png)\\n\\n## New Asset Releases\\nWe\'re excited to announce two new 3D assets created with UModeler X on the Unity Asset Store: `Warm Dream Room`, a cozy space designed for VRChat, and `Sunset Train`, featuring warm, nostalgic aesthetics.\\n\\n<div class=\\"showcase-container\\">\\n   <div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n       <div class=\\"card\\">                        \\n           <img src={require(\'./img/warm-dream-room.png\').default} alt=\\"Warm Dream Room\\"/>\\n           <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Warm Dream Room (UModeler X)</h3>\\n           <a href=\\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/warm-dream-room-umodeler-x-303461\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Check in Asset Store</a>\\n       </div>\\n   </div>\\n   <div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n       <div class=\\"card\\">                        \\n           <img src={require(\'./img/sunset-train.png\').default} alt=\\"Sunset Train\\"/>\\n           <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Sunset Train (UModeler X)</h3>\\n           <a href=\\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/sunset-train-umodeler-x-304862\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Check in Asset Store</a>\\n       </div>\\n   </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n## Pro License\\nUModeler X Plus introduces over 20 new features compared to the Basic version. Moving forward, Plus will focus on stability improvements and performance optimization rather than new feature additions.\\n\\nThe upcoming Pro license will include all Plus features while continuously adding new functionality. Pro will be offered as a subscription model to ensure sustainable company operations and stable development of UModeler X. This model will enable us to provide regular updates, new feature development, and enhanced technical support.\\n\\n   <div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n       <div class=\\"card\\">                        \\n           <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Get the lastest news of UModeler X Pro</h3>\\n           <a href=\\"https://mailchi.mp/umodeler/signup\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Subscribe Newsletter</a>\\n       </div>\\n   </div>\\n\\nThank you for your continued support of UModeler X.\\nBest regards!"},{"id":"umodeler-x-plus-1-0-release-and-sales-events","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-plus-1-0-release-and-sales-events","source":"@site/blog/2024-11-20/2024-11-20.md","title":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 Official Release & Holiday Sales Events Announcement - November 20, 2024","description":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 will be officially released on November 20th, 2024. Take advantage of our special holiday sales events, including Black Friday, Cyber Week, and New Year sales running through January 2025. Get both UModeler and UModeler X Plus together for up to 31% savings off the regular price. Purchase UModeler during the sale periods and upgrade to UModeler X Plus to maximize your savings.\\n","date":"2024-11-20T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"November 20, 2024","tags":[{"label":"UModeler X Plus","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-plus"},{"label":"Release Date","permalink":"/blog/tags/release-date"},{"label":"Holiday Sales","permalink":"/blog/tags/holiday-sales"},{"label":"Black Friday","permalink":"/blog/tags/black-friday"},{"label":"Cyber Week","permalink":"/blog/tags/cyber-week"},{"label":"New Year Sale","permalink":"/blog/tags/new-year-sale"},{"label":"Unity Asset Store","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity-asset-store"},{"label":"Bundle Savings","permalink":"/blog/tags/bundle-savings"},{"label":"Special Pricing","permalink":"/blog/tags/special-pricing"},{"label":"3D Modeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/3-d-modeling"}],"readingTime":2.63,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 Official Release & Holiday Sales Events Announcement - November 20, 2024","slug":"umodeler-x-plus-1-0-release-and-sales-events","description":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 will be officially released on November 20th, 2024. Take advantage of our special holiday sales events, including Black Friday, Cyber Week, and New Year sales running through January 2025. Get both UModeler and UModeler X Plus together for up to 31% savings off the regular price. Purchase UModeler during the sale periods and upgrade to UModeler X Plus to maximize your savings.\\n","authors":"jaesik","tags":["UModeler X Plus","Release Date","Holiday Sales","Black Friday","Cyber Week","New Year Sale","Unity Asset Store","Bundle Savings","Special Pricing","3D Modeling"],"hide_table_of_contents":false,"date":"2024-11-20T00:00:00.000Z","lastmod":"2024-11-20T00:00:00.000Z","image":"./img/umodeler-x-plus-secret-weapon.png"},"prevItem":{"title":"UModeler X 2025 New Year Update","permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-2025-jan-news"},"nextItem":{"title":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 Release Date Announcement","permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-plus-1-0-release-date-announcement"}},"content":"![](./img/umodeler-x-plus-secret-weapon.png)\\n\\nWe are thrilled to announce that UModeler X Plus 1.0 will be officially released on **November 20, 2024**, marking a significant milestone in 3D content creation for Unity developers. Following our successful Early Bird release in September, we have enhanced and refined our toolset to deliver a powerful modeling solution that will be available starting November 20th.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## Release Details and Pricing\\n* UModeler X Plus 1.0 will be released on **November 20, 2024** at **$199**\\n* Special upgrade price of **$99** for existing UModeler users\\n\\n## Unity Asset Store Sale Periods\\n\\nUModeler will be available at special discounted prices during three major sales:\\n\\n### Black Friday Sale / Cyber Week Sale\\n- Duration: **November 20**, 2024 9pm PT - **December 11**, 2024 8am PT\\n- Special Discounts:\\n  * December 10: **70% off** (Flash Deal)\\n  * December 11: **60% off**\\n\\n### New Year Sale\\n- Duration: **December 18**, 2024 8am PT - **January 10**, 2025 8am PT\\n- Discount: **50% off**\\n\\n## Limited-Time Bundle Savings\\nDuring the sale period, if you purchase [UModeler](https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-80868) first and then upgrade to [UModeler X Plus 1.0](https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-x-plus-early-bird-288107), you can save up to 31% compared to buying UModeler X Plus 1.0 directly. Here\'s the breakdown of savings:\\n\\n* During **70%** Flash Deal **(Dec.10)**: UModeler ($37.5) + upgrade to X Plus ($99) = **$136.5 (31% less than buying X Plus alone)**\\n* During **60%** off **(Dec.11**): UModeler ($50) + upgrade to X Plus ($99) = **$149 (25% less than buying X Plus alone)**\\n* During **50%** off **(Dec.18.2024 ~ Jan.10.2025)** : UModeler ($62.5) + upgrade to X Plus ($99) = **$161.5 (19% less than buying X Plus alone)**\\n\\nBy following this purchase order, you\'ll not only save up to **31%** compared to buying UModeler X Plus 1.0 directly at $199, but you\'ll also own both UModeler and UModeler X Plus!\\n\\n<div class=\\"showcase-container\\">\\n   <div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n       <div class=\\"card\\">                        \\n           <img src={require(\'./img/umodeler.png\').default} alt=\\"UModeler\\"/>\\n           <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">UModeler</h3>\\n           <p>Lightweight tool for level design and low-poly environmental modeling</p>\\n           <a href=\\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-80868\\" class=\\"card-link\\">More info</a>\\n       </div>\\n   </div>\\n   <div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n       <div class=\\"card\\">                        \\n           <img src={require(\'./img/umodeler-x-plus.png\').default} alt=\\"UModeler X Plus 1.0\\"/>\\n           <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">UModeler X Plus 1.0</h3>\\n           <p>From high-poly modeling to rigging, painting, and AI texturing</p>\\n           <a href=\\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-x-plus-288107\\" class=\\"card-link\\">More info</a>\\n       </div>\\n   </div>\\n</div>\\n\\nFor complete information about UModeler X Plus 1.0 features, recent improvements, and our roadmap through 2024, please refer to our previous blog post: [UModeler X Plus 1.0 Release Date Announcement](../2024-11-12/2024-11-12.md)\\n\\n## New Assets Made with UModeler X\\nCheck out our latest showcase assets on the Unity Asset Store demonstrating UModeler X\'s capabilities:\\n\\n<div class=\\"showcase-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n        <div class=\\"card\\">                        \\n            <img src={require(\'./img/sunny-hill-village.png\').default} alt=\\"Sunny Hill Village\\"/>\\n            <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Sunny Hill Village on the Asset Store</h3>\\n            <p>A charming European-style village environment.</p>\\n            <a href=\\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/historic/sunny-hill-village-umodeler-x-298508\\" class=\\"card-link\\">More info</a>\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n        <div class=\\"card\\">                        \\n            <img src={require(\'./img/mono-beige-room.png\').default} alt=\\"Mono Beige Room\\"/>\\n            <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Mono Beige Room on the Asset Store</h3>\\n            <p>A modern minimalist bedroom interior.</p>\\n            <a href=\\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/mono-beige-room-umodeler-x-301789\\" class=\\"card-link\\">More info</a>\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\nUModeler X Plus 1.0 has become a reality thanks to your enthusiastic support and valuable feedback. We are committed to continuously improving UModeler X, actively incorporating your feedback to create an even more stable and helpful tool for our community. Thank you for being part of this journey with UModeler, Inc."},{"id":"umodeler-x-plus-1-0-release-date-announcement","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-plus-1-0-release-date-announcement","source":"@site/blog/2024-11-12/2024-11-12.md","title":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 Release Date Announcement","description":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 official version will be released on November 20th, featuring enhanced modeling tools, Humonoid Avatar support, and improved UI systems. While some SketchUp-style modeling features will be gradually implemented post-release, new features like Normal Painting compensate for this adjustment.","date":"2024-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"November 12, 2024","tags":[{"label":"UModeler X Plus","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-plus"},{"label":"Release Date","permalink":"/blog/tags/release-date"},{"label":"SketchUp Style Modeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/sketch-up-style-modeling"},{"label":"Hotspot Texturing","permalink":"/blog/tags/hotspot-texturing"},{"label":"Normal Painting","permalink":"/blog/tags/normal-painting"},{"label":"Humonoid Avatar","permalink":"/blog/tags/humonoid-avatar"},{"label":"Debug UI","permalink":"/blog/tags/debug-ui"},{"label":"Display Settings","permalink":"/blog/tags/display-settings"}],"readingTime":2.085,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 Release Date Announcement","slug":"umodeler-x-plus-1-0-release-date-announcement","description":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 official version will be released on November 20th, featuring enhanced modeling tools, Humonoid Avatar support, and improved UI systems. While some SketchUp-style modeling features will be gradually implemented post-release, new features like Normal Painting compensate for this adjustment.","authors":"jaesik","tags":["UModeler X Plus","Release Date","SketchUp Style Modeling","Hotspot Texturing","Normal Painting","Humonoid Avatar","Debug UI","Display Settings"],"image":"./img/umodeler-x-plus-1.0.jpg","hide_table_of_contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 Official Release & Holiday Sales Events Announcement - November 20, 2024","permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-plus-1-0-release-and-sales-events"},"nextItem":{"title":"UModeler X Achievements and News - October 2024","permalink":"/blog/Oct-27th-2024-blog"}},"content":"![](./img/umodeler-x-plus-1.0.jpg)\\n\\nHello UModeler X Plus users,\\n\\nWe are excited to announce that UModeler X Plus 1.0 official version will be released on ``November 20th``. Since the Early Bird version release in September, our team has been working diligently to prepare for the official version.\\n\\nHowever, we need to share one piece of news that might disappoint you. The SketchUp-style modeling features we promised in September won\'t be fully implemented by the ``20th``. Implementing these features perfectly in the new UModeler X architecture has presented more technical challenges than anticipated. We plan to enhance this functionality through continuous updates after the 1.0 release.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nSpecifically, the Line tool will be moved to the Add group and renamed to Knife tool to better reflect its polygon-cutting functionality. Additionally, a new Poly Line tool will be added to the Drawing group to support SketchUp-style modeling. As for Hotspot texturing, we will first provide it at the existing UModeler level and implement additional features gradually after the release.\\n\\nTo compensate for these adjustments, we have prepared several new features:\\n- Normal Painting (released in October)\\n- Humanoid Avatar support\\n- Enhanced Display/Debug/Snap Settings UI\\n- Separate Parts Tool\\n- Offline use available\\n\\nWe are confident these new features will significantly improve your 3D content creation workflow.\\n\\nWe are prioritizing the development of SketchUp-style modeling and Hotspot texturing, aiming to complete them within this year. We will regularly share development progress updates with you.\\n\\n**Here are the key features included in UModeler X Plus 1.0:**\\n\\n1. SketchUp Style Modeling (including PushPull tool) ver 0.7\\n2. Hotspot Texturing Tool\\n3. Follow Tool\\n4. Array Modifier and Tools\\n5. Normal Painting\\n6. .OBJ, .STL, .PLY Exporter\\n7. Humanoid Avatar support\\n8. Multi UV support\\n9. Scene saving support for UModeler X 3D model data\\n10. Enhanced Debug, Display Settings UI\\n11. World and Increment options added to Snap Panel window\\n12. Separate Parts Tool\\n13. Side Stair Tool\\n14. Enhanced Edge Eraser Tool\\n15. Offline use available\\n\\n**Post-1.0 UModeler X Plus Roadmap in 2024**\\n- SketchUp Style Modeling ver 1.0\\n  - Supports for connecting outer polygons with inner holes.\\n  - Enhance the stability.\\n  - and more.\\n- Additional Hotspot Texturing features\\n  - Trim sheet\\n  - Group-based hotspots\\n- Improved Pivot Gizmo system\\n\\nOne more thing\u2014the Plus version will not participate in the Black Friday sale, and the early bird pricing will end then.\\n\\nWe look forward to bringing you the official release news on ``November 20th``. \\n\\n\\nThank you for your continued support."},{"id":"Oct-27th-2024-blog","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/Oct-27th-2024-blog","source":"@site/blog/2024-10-27/2024-10-27.md","title":"UModeler X Achievements and News - October 2024","description":"Latest updates including Unite 2024 participation, 16th Unity Awards results, Plus version updates, and exciting news about games developed with UModeler.","date":"2024-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"October 27, 2024","tags":[{"label":"UModeler X Plus","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-plus"},{"label":"Unite 2024","permalink":"/blog/tags/unite-2024"},{"label":"16th Unity Awards","permalink":"/blog/tags/16th-unity-awards"},{"label":"Code Monkey","permalink":"/blog/tags/code-monkey"},{"label":"Little Kitty Big City","permalink":"/blog/tags/little-kitty-big-city"},{"label":"Cube of Light Resurrection","permalink":"/blog/tags/cube-of-light-resurrection"},{"label":"Wendigo Hunter","permalink":"/blog/tags/wendigo-hunter"}],"readingTime":4.76,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"UModeler X Achievements and News - October 2024","slug":"Oct-27th-2024-blog","description":"Latest updates including Unite 2024 participation, 16th Unity Awards results, Plus version updates, and exciting news about games developed with UModeler.","authors":"jaesik","tags":["UModeler X Plus","Unite 2024","16th Unity Awards","Code Monkey","Little Kitty Big City","Cube of Light Resurrection","Wendigo Hunter"],"image":"./img/umodeler-unite2024.jpg","hide_table_of_contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"UModeler X Plus 1.0 Release Date Announcement","permalink":"/blog/umodeler-x-plus-1-0-release-date-announcement"},"nextItem":{"title":"UModeler X Plus Early Bird - Finally Released!","permalink":"/blog/September-14th-2024-blog"}},"content":"Hello everyone,\\n\\nWe\'re excited to share some thrilling updates about UModeler from October 2024 with our community.\\n\\n## Unite 2024 Participation\\n\\nUModeler participated as a sponsor at Unite 2024 (September 18-20, 2023), drawing significant attention from developers worldwide. Notably, we received exceptional interest not only from game developers but also from university educators and students, highlighting how in-Unity 3D modeling capabilities can significantly lower the barriers to education and learning.\\n\\n![](./img/umodeler-unite2024.jpg)\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## UModeler X Plus Early Bird Reaches #1 in Popularity\\n\\nA remarkable achievement was the \'UModeler X Plus Early Bird\' version reaching #1 in overall popularity on the Unity Asset Store just two days after its release on September 14th. This incredible success demonstrates developers\' high expectations and trust in UModeler X Plus.\\n\\n![](./img/unity-asset-store-chart-number-one.png)\\n\\n## Continuous Evolution: 7 Significant Updates\\n\\nUModeler X Plus Early Bird has undergone remarkable development through seven updates, from `0.91.1` to `0.92.0`. Let\'s look at the key updates.\\n\\n### Core New Features\\n\\n- **Align Tool**: Precisely align model vertices according to various criteria\\n\\n    ![](./img/modelingmode-aligntool.gif)\\n\\n- **Normal Painting Tool**: Advanced functionality for converting height maps to normal maps\\n\\n    <div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n      <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/67foddUDzis?si=34KHMBrir3SndPsN\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n    </div>\\n\\n### Usability Improvements\\n\\n- **Enhanced Tablet Support**: Automatic brush opacity and size adjustment based on pressure sensitivity\\n- **Clear Unused Assets**: Efficient scene data cleanup\\n- **Primitive Shapes**: Automatic object naming functionality\\n- **Vertex Position Editor**: Precise position editing in local/world coordinate systems\\n\\n### Performance and Stability\\n\\n- Improved compatibility with Unity 6.0+\\n- Multi-material handling optimization\\n- Enhanced UV and normal calculation accuracy\\n- Various bug fixes and performance improvements\\n\\nFor more detailed information, please check the [UModeler X Plus Release Notes](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/releasenote/umodelerx-plus).\\n\\n## UModeler X Plus 1.0\\n\\nUModeler X Plus 1.0\'s official release is scheduled for Wednesday, November 20th. As previewed in September, it will feature significantly upgraded capabilities.\\n\\n### Enhanced Modeling System\\n\\n- **Upgraded SketchUp Style Modeling**: Continuous improvements for intuitive modeling workflow\\n- **Follow Tool**: Enhanced power with progressive generation capabilities added to the existing robust Follow tool\\n- **Hotspot Texturing**: Improved UI/UX and trim sheet support for enhanced texturing experience\\n\\n### System Improvements\\n\\n- **Enhanced Save System**: Simultaneous .asset and .unity scene file saving for lighter project management\\n- **Humanoid Avatar Support**: Complete Humanoid Avatar support in rigging mode for streamlined animation application\\n\\n## User-Centric License Policy Improvements\\n\\nAfter careful consideration of user feedback, UModeler has enhanced its licensing policy:\\n\\n### Basic Version\\n\\n- Free for both commercial and non-commercial use\\n- Updates focused on major bug fixes\\n- Internet connection required\\n- User data collection for service improvement\\n- Current feature set maintained\\n\\n### Plus Version (After 1.0 Release)\\n\\n- Premium license supporting both commercial and non-commercial use\\n- Rapid updates and priority feedback implementation\\n- Offline usage available\\n- Optional user data collection\\n- Advanced features including SketchUp-style modeling, Hotspot texturing, Array tool/modifier, Follow tool, Align tool, and Normal painting\\n\\n## Community Recognition\\n\\nUModeler\'s innovation and excellence are being recognized across various platforms:\\n\\n### Unity Awards 2024 Achievement\\n\\n  - Finalist in the Artistic Tool category at the 16th Unity Awards\\n  - Competed alongside prestigious nominees like RetargetPro and Foliage Renderer\\n  - COZY: Stylized Weather 3 won the final results announced on October 23rd\\n  - Congratulations to Distant Lands\' COZY team, we\'ll return stronger next time\\n        \\n    ![](./img/16th-unity-awards.webp)\\n\\n### Featured by Code Monkey, Popular YouTuber with 540K Subscribers\\n\\n  - Selected for **Systems and Tools - October 2024** recommended list\\n  - Highly recommended as essential tool for Unity developers\\n  - Special 10% discount with code \'CODEMONKEY10\'\\n  \\n  ![](./img/code-monkey-october-2024.webp)\\n\\n  <div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HUuMIJVLPGI?si=uJijaumnikOvMbaB\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n  </div>\\n\\n## Notable Games Created with UModeler\\n\\nHere are the latest updates on games developed using UModeler products over the past month.\\n\\n### Cube of Light Resurrection - Well-made Mobile RPG\\n  - Mobile-optimized roguelite shooting RPG\\n  - Procedurally generated maps and 100+ enemy types\\n  - Strategic combat with diverse weapons and skills\\n  - Optimized graphics and stunning visual effects created with UModeler\\n\\n![](./img/cube.webp)\\n\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Cube of Light Resurrection</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hornSpirit.CubeOfLife&hl=ko\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Google Store</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n\\n### Little Kitty Big City - 2024 Golden Joystick Awards Nominee\\n  - Notable nominee for the prestigious Golden Joystick Awards\\n  - Charming open-world game featuring a cat\'s city adventure\\n  - Delightful city environment and rich interactions built with UModeler\\n\\n![](./img/littlekitty.jpg)\\n\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">2024 Golden Joystick Awards</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"https://www.gamesradar.com/goldenjoystickawards/\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Vote</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n### Wendigo Hunter - Anticipated Steam Release\\n  - Highly anticipated Q1 2025 Steam release\\n  - Dark fantasy action set in ancient dungeons\\n  - Immersive dungeon environments created with UModeler\\n\\n![](./img/wendigo-hunter.jpg)\\n\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Wendigo Hunter</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2326040/Wendigo_Hunter/\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Steam</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n### Impressive Student Developer FPS Project\\n  - Strategic multiplayer map set in Provence\\n  - Professional-quality implementation using UModeler X and various assets\\n  - Balanced level design combining aesthetics and gameplay\\n  \\n\\n\\n  <div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WZmfBL3lXrQ?si=s7skK5L-xY61oeev\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n  </div>\\n\\n### Community Showcase: Stunning Level Design from Discord\\nWe\'re excited to showcase an extraordinary piece from our Discord community. User Daelon recently shared a high-quality level created with UModeler, pushing the boundaries of what\'s possible with our tool through its remarkable polish and attention to detail. This work, shared on our Discord server, represents perhaps the finest user-created content we\'ve seen to date. It perfectly demonstrates the professional-grade results achievable with UModeler in the hands of a skilled artist. You can check out this impressive work in our Discord community\\n\\n![](./img/fantasytown_screen-11.jpg)\\n![](./img/fantasytown_screen-45.jpg)\\n\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Discord Community</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"https://discord.com/channels/496255145693282305/1125327562239918112/1284191965998481480\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\nThese diverse projects demonstrate that UModeler is an outstanding game creation tool, regardless of genre or scale. <br /><br />\\n\\nUModeler remains committed to listening to user feedback and continuously improving the 3D modeling experience. Your valuable opinions drive UModeler\'s evolution. Thank you for your continued support and interest."},{"id":"September-14th-2024-blog","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/September-14th-2024-blog","source":"@site/blog/2024-09-14/2024-09-14.md","title":"UModeler X Plus Early Bird - Finally Released!","description":"Hello everyone,","date":"2024-09-14T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"September 14, 2024","tags":[{"label":"UModeler X Plus","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-plus"}],"readingTime":4.17,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"UModeler X Plus Early Bird - Finally Released!","slug":"September-14th-2024-blog","authors":"jaesik","tags":["UModeler X Plus"],"image":"./img/UModelerXPlus.jpg","hide_table_of_contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"UModeler X Achievements and News - October 2024","permalink":"/blog/Oct-27th-2024-blog"},"nextItem":{"title":"Unite 2024 Sponsorship and UModeler X Plus Release News","permalink":"/blog/August-27th-2024-blog"}},"content":"Hello everyone,\\n\\nI\u2019m excited to share some great news with you today. **UModeler X Plus** has finally launched on the Asset Store! In this blog, we\u2019ll cover some useful information about UModeler X Plus.\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cTDeJwvmpHE?si=6JEDHitUKXi9eAhU\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## Introducing UModeler X Plus\\n\\n**UModeler X Plus** combines the strengths of the original UModeler and UModeler X Beta. This tool makes real-time 3D content creation within Unity easier and more efficient, becoming the go-to 3D asset creation solution for Unity developers.\\n\\n## New Features in the Plus Version\\n\\nUModeler X Plus offers exciting additional features that make 3D modeling and texturing even more convenient\\n\\n1. **`SketchUp Style Modeling`**\\n2. **`Push/Pull Tool`**\\n3. **`Hotspot Texturing Tool`**\\n4. **`Follow Tool`**\\n5. **`Array Modifier and Tools`**\\n6. **`Normal Painting`**\\n7. **`.OBJ, .STL, .PLY Exporter`**\\n\\n## Differences between Plus, Basic (Beta), and the Original UModeler\\n\\nYou can easily see the differences between these three versions in the FAQ page via the table provided.\\n\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">        \\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Product Comparison Table</h3>\\n        <p>Check out the feature differences between UModeler X Plus, UModeler X Basic, and the original UModeler.</p>\\n        <a href=\\"/docs/faq#what-are-the-differences-between-umodeler-x-and-the-original-umodeler\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Learn More</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n## Early Bird Version Info for September\\n\\nThe current Early Bird Version (0.90) includes the following features\\n- **`Array Modifier and Tool`**\\n- **`.OBJ, .STL, .PLY Exporter`**\\n- **`SketchUp Style Modeling and Push/Pull Tool (Beta)`**\\n\\n### Future Updates\\n\\n- More features will be added progressively throughout October and November.\\n- The full version (1.0) with all features will be released in November.\\n- If you purchase the Early Bird version of UModeler X, it will automatically upgrade to UModeler X Plus at no additional cost once the full version is released.\\n\\n## Special Bonus Offer\\n\\nComplete the registration and verification process after purchasing UModeler X Plus to receive the following assets for free.\\n- **Isometric Low-Poly Room Asset (Available for immediate download)**\\n<div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vV9J_3jGdW8?si=pPx0FxnvXyocuyZn\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n    \\n- **Dystopian Building Asset (Available in October)**\\n<div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eDAPujz1j4g?si=RC3H7rh3zMizUnOn\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\nThese bonus assets are provided through the UModeler Hub.\\n\\n## Version Information and Data Compatibility\\n\\n- The existing UModeler X Beta is now renamed UModeler X Basic, but its features remain unchanged.\\n- Only one version (Basic or Plus) can be installed per project.\\n- All features will work smoothly when upgrading from Beta or Basic to Plus.\\n- Data is fully compatible between UModeler X Basic and Plus.\\n\\n## What about the UModeler X Beta Version?\\n\\nThe existing Beta version will be automatically updated to the Basic 1.0 version, and all features in the Beta will continue to be available for free.\\n\\n## Special Discount Announcement\\n\\n- September: **`75% Discount`**\\n- From October until the full release: 50% Discount:  **`50% Discount`**\\n\\nDon\'t miss this special opportunity! It will be sold for **`$199`** when version 1.0 officially launches in November.\\n\\nFor those who have already purchased UModeler, the upgrade to the Plus version is available for **`only $40`** in September.\\n\\n| Period | Plus | Upgrade Fee (UModeler \u2192 UModeler X Plus) |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| September | **$49 USD** (UNITE Special, **75% off**) | **$40 USD** |\\n| October | **$99 USD** (Early Bird, **50% off**) | **$70 USD** |\\n| From November | **$199 USD** (Official Release) | **$140 USD** |\\n\\n- The upgrade fee will be automatically applied in the Unity Asset Store if you purchased UModeler there.\\n- The upgrade fee may change based on circumstances.\\n\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">                        \\n        <img src={require(\'./img/icon_01_plus.png\').default} />\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">UModeler X Plus on the Asset Store</h3>\\n        <p>Get UModeler X Plus at a 75% discount or more on the Unity Asset Store. This offer is available only until the end of September.</p>\\n        <a href=\\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/slug/288107\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Buy Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n## UModeler X Plus website has launched!\\nWould you like to quickly check out all the information about UModeler X Plus at a glance? Visit the newly revamped UModeler X Plus website. You can quickly find everything from key features and pricing policies to stunning assets created with UModeler X.\\n\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">UModeler X Plus Website</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"https://www.unity.umodeler.com\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Chekc out</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n## Troubleshooting\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Internal Server Error (500)</h3>\\n        <p>If an Internal Server Error (500) occurs while unlocking UModeler X Plus in the hub, please refer to the page below.</p>\\n        <a href=\\"/docs/troubleshooting#when-i-enter-the-invoice-number-or-order-id-on-the-umodeler-x-plus-unlock-page-an-internal-server-error-500-occurs\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Chekc out</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n## Conclusion\\n\\nUModeler X Plus will take your Unity game development to the next level. Explore its new features and experience more creative and efficient workflows with UModeler X Plus.\\n\\nIf you encounter any issues or have any questions while using UModeler X, please refer to the FAQ or Troubleshooting page, or contact us via email or our Discord server.\\n\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">FAQ</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"/docs/faq/\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Troubleshooting</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"/docs/troubleshooting/\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Discord</h3>\\n        <p>UModeler\'s official Discord Server</p>\\n        <a href=\\"https://discord.gg/jvZmTkKbfF\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Email</h3>\\n        <p>contact.support@umodeler.com</p>\\n        <a href=\\"mailto:contact.support@umodeler.com\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Send</a>\\n    </div>    \\n</div>"},{"id":"August-27th-2024-blog","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/August-27th-2024-blog","source":"@site/blog/2024-08-27/2024-08-27.md","title":"Unite 2024 Sponsorship and UModeler X Plus Release News","description":"Discover UModeler\'s sponsorship of Unite 2024, the early bird release of UModeler X Plus, and the latest updates and special discount offers!","date":"2024-08-27T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"August 27, 2024","tags":[{"label":"Unite2024","permalink":"/blog/tags/unite-2024"},{"label":"UModeler Plus Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-plus-unity"},{"label":"Modeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/modeling"},{"label":"Rigging","permalink":"/blog/tags/rigging"},{"label":"Painting","permalink":"/blog/tags/painting"},{"label":"LicenseModel","permalink":"/blog/tags/license-model"},{"label":"Roadmap","permalink":"/blog/tags/roadmap"},{"label":"Prototyping","permalink":"/blog/tags/prototyping"},{"label":"Level Design","permalink":"/blog/tags/level-design"}],"readingTime":4.97,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Unite 2024 Sponsorship and UModeler X Plus Release News","description":"Discover UModeler\'s sponsorship of Unite 2024, the early bird release of UModeler X Plus, and the latest updates and special discount offers!","slug":"August-27th-2024-blog","authors":"jaesik","tags":["Unite2024","UModeler Plus Unity","Modeling","Rigging","Painting","LicenseModel","Roadmap","Prototyping","Level Design"],"image":"./img/unity-unite2024-sponsor.png","hide table of contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"UModeler X Plus Early Bird - Finally Released!","permalink":"/blog/September-14th-2024-blog"},"nextItem":{"title":"UModeler X License Model, Technical Roadmap and Latest Updates","permalink":"/blog/July-26th-2024-blog"}},"content":"Hello,\\n\\nI\u2019m Jaesik Hwang, CEO and Team Manager of UModeler.\\n\\nTime flies, and another month has passed quickly. As always, I\'m here to share various UModeler updates from the past month.\\n\\n## Sponsorship of Unity Unite 2024\\n\\n[![unity-unite2024-sponsor](./img/unity-unite2024-sponsor.png)](https://unity.com/events/unite)\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nUModeler is sponsoring the upcoming Unite 2024 event, which will be held from September 18th to 20th, 2024. We will also have a booth where you can learn about the latest updates on UModeler X. If you are in Barcelona, please drop by and say hello.\\n\\nIf you have any questions about UModeler X or are interested in exploring new business opportunities with us, feel free to contact us in advance at [Contact.Support@umodeler.com](mailto:Contact.Support@umodeler.com).\\n\\n## UModeler X Plus Discount Event\\n\\nCoinciding with the Unite event, the early bird version of UModeler X Plus will be released. For about two weeks, you can get UModeler X Plus at a whopping 75% discount off the official November release price of $199.\\n\\nWe also offer a special upgrade option for existing UModeler users. The upgrade cost is also discounted during the early bird period, so don\u2019t miss out on this great opportunity.\\n\\n![sale-prices](./img/sale-prices.png)\\n\\n## New UModeler Features and more Coming Soon\\n\\nThe schedule for adding UModeler features and more to UModeler X Plus is as follows:\\n\\n- **September 2024**\\n  - SketchUp Style Modeling Beta\\n  - PushPull Tool Beta\\n  - .OBJ, .STL, and .PLY Exporters\\n  - Array Modifier and Tool\\n- **October 2024**\\n  - Normal Painting\\n- **November 2024**\\n  - Hotspot Texturing Tool\\n  - SketchUp Style Modeling Full Version\\n  - PushPull Tool Full Version\\n  - Follow Tool\\n  - Multi UV Channels Editing\\n\\nUModeler X Plus builds on the strong foundation of UModeler X Beta by adding essential UModeler features like SketchUp Style Modeling, Hotspot Texturing, Clone (Array) Tool, Follow Tool, Export Tool and Normal Painting allowing you to leverage all of UModeler\u2019s powerful capabilities.\\n\\n| Category | Function | UModeler | UModeler X Basic | UModeler X Plus |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| Modeling | Polygon Editing | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | \u2514 Array(Clone) Tool | \u2714\ufe0f | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | \u2514 Follow Tool | \u2714\ufe0f | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | SketchUp Style Modeling | \u2714\ufe0f | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | Push Pull  | \u2714\ufe0f | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | Modifiers | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | \u2514 Array Modifier | \u274c | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | .OBJ Exporter | \u2714\ufe0f | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | .PLY, .STL Exporter | \u274c | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | Processable Face Count | Low-poly | High-poly | Low/High-poly |\\n| UV Editing | UV Unwrap | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | \u2514 LSCM Algorithm UV Unwrap | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | Multi UV Channel Editing | \u274c | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | Hotspot Texturing | \u2714\ufe0f | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n| Rigging | Bone Editing | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | Weight Editing | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | Auto Rigging | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | \u2514 Auto Weight | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | \u2514 Build Bone | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n| Painting | 3D Painting | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | Layer-based Texturing | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | Brush Editing | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | Normal Painting | \u274c | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n|  | AI Texturing 1.0 | \u274c | \u2714\ufe0f | \u2714\ufe0f |\\n\\n## License Information Update\\n\\nLast month, we provided detailed information about the UModeler X license. This time, we\u2019re sharing information that includes pricing. With the official release of the Plus version in November, we\u2019re also planning to launch Pro and Team licenses in the first quarter of next year. We\u2019ll keep you updated on the progress.\\n\\n![License-information](./img/License-information.PNG)\\n\\n## Tutorial Videos by Indie Game Hustle\\n\\nDo you remember Indie Game Hustle? The Unity developer and YouTuber who created a tutorial series that was loved by many UModeler users is back with a new set of tutorials for UModeler X. Learn UModeler X easily and enjoyably with his videos that highlight the key features.\\n\\n[![indie-game-hustle-umodelerx-tutorial-list](./img/indie-game-hustle-umodelerx-tutorial-list.PNG)](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLVpxoFqeUjC87LtO1z0blYRdwXyHE_Yjc)\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-aXahQaD5QI?si=8Y7gNJM07Ob1-JYy\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n<br />\\n\\n## UModeler Introduction by Golden Metal\\n\\nDuring the August Summer Sale, Korea\u2019s famous Unity developer and YouTuber Golden Metal introduced UModeler with a fantastic video. You\u2019ll find plenty of inspiration from watching him use UModeler at the start of the video.\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Lc2CD57sCNk?si=6O9gG8PtqINxaarj\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n<br />\\n\\n## UModeler X Update Details\\n\\nAfter the 0.19.0 update in February, we\u2019re excited to announce the 0.20.0 update, bringing new features for the first time in six months. This major update introduces the Face Color Tool and UV Param Tool, which were previously available in UModeler. Additionally, the Face Normal Tool, allowing you to edit the normal direction of faces, has been added in version 0.20.4.\\n\\n### Face Color Tool\\n\\nThis tool allows you to apply the desired color to selected faces. It is very useful when assigning colors or properties using RGBA values at the face level.\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7PM2a91jBeQ?si=RsTjHlK8sdA0g57k\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n<br />\\n\\n<div class=\\"card\\">    \\n    <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Face Color Tool</h3>\\n    <a href=\\"/docs/modeling/facecolor-tool\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go to Documentation</a>\\n</div>\\n\\n### UV Param Tool\\n\\nThis tool allows you to transform UVs of unwrapped faces using properties like Shift, Rotate, and Scale.\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/M-D6jwsVdKI?si=HR2zXql4gAkFXMeU\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n<br />\\n\\n<div class=\\"card\\">    \\n    <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">UV Param Tool</h3>\\n    <a href=\\"/docs/modeling/uvparam-tool\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go to Documentation</a>\\n</div>\\n\\n### Face Normal Tool\\n\\nThis tool allows you to change the normal direction of selected faces. The manual page will be added soon.\\n\\n![License-information](./img/FaceNormalTool.gif)\\n\\n---\\n\\nThat\u2019s all for this update. After returning from Unite 2024, I\u2019ll bring you more exciting news next month."},{"id":"July-26th-2024-blog","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/July-26th-2024-blog","source":"@site/blog/2024-07-26/2024-07-26.md","title":"UModeler X License Model, Technical Roadmap and Latest Updates","description":"Explore the details of the new license models Plus, Pro, and Team, as well as the technical roadmap extending to the first quarter of 2025. You can also check out the major features added in the recent updates.","date":"2024-07-26T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"July 26, 2024","tags":[{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"Modeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/modeling"},{"label":"Rigging","permalink":"/blog/tags/rigging"},{"label":"Painting","permalink":"/blog/tags/painting"},{"label":"LicenseModel","permalink":"/blog/tags/license-model"},{"label":"Roadmap","permalink":"/blog/tags/roadmap"},{"label":"Prototyping","permalink":"/blog/tags/prototyping"},{"label":"Level Design","permalink":"/blog/tags/level-design"}],"readingTime":3.455,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"UModeler X License Model, Technical Roadmap and Latest Updates","description":"Explore the details of the new license models Plus, Pro, and Team, as well as the technical roadmap extending to the first quarter of 2025. You can also check out the major features added in the recent updates.","slug":"July-26th-2024-blog","authors":"jaesik","tags":["Unity","Modeling","Rigging","Painting","LicenseModel","Roadmap","Prototyping","Level Design"],"image":"./img/UModelerXLicenseTable.png","hide_table_of_contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"Unite 2024 Sponsorship and UModeler X Plus Release News","permalink":"/blog/August-27th-2024-blog"},"nextItem":{"title":"Low Poly Tutorials, Zepeto Guidebook, UModeler X Enhancements, and FIA Game Jam Results","permalink":"/blog/June-22th-2024-blog"}},"content":"![isometric-thumbnail](./img/UModelerXLicenseTable.png)\\n\\nHello,\\n\\nAs we approach the end of July, we\'re here with a new blog post. Over the past month, there have been many updates not only in development but also in our business model. In this blog post, we will share these updates with you.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## UModeler X License Model\\n\\nSince last September, UModeler X has received various feedback from approximately 4,200 users during the beta testing phase, making it a more powerful and stable tool. Finally, the licensing model for UModeler X has been somewhat finalized. Even after the new licensing model is applied, the various modeling, rigging, painting, and AI texturing tools provided in the existing beta version will continue to be available for free with **`the Basic license`**.\\n\\n**`The Plus License`** includes all the features of **`the Basic license`**, along with the core features and major tools of UModeler, aiming to fully replace the original UModeler. Existing UModeler users will have the benefit of purchasing the Plus license at an upgrade price. This Plus license is scheduled to be released as an early bird version in September 2024, with the official version launching on the Unity Asset Store in November 2024.\\n\\n**`The Pro and Team licenses`**, which will be subscription-based, are set to be unveiled early next year. These licenses will not only include all the features of the Plus license but also provide the fastest access to the latest features of UModeler X.\\n\\nFor more information on the UModeler X license, please refer to the FAQ page below.\\n\\n<div class=\\"card\\">    \\n    <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">UModeler X License Model</h3>\\n    <a href=\\"/docs/faq/#what-is-umodeler-xs-pricing-model\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go to</a>\\n</div>\\n\\n## Technical Roadmap\\n\\nAlong with the confirmation of the licensing model, the technical roadmap has also been somewhat defined.\\n\\nAll upcoming license models will include the **`Texture Parameter Tool`** and **`Face Color Tool`** currently available in **`the Beta version`**.\\n\\n**`The Plus license`** will feature the core functions of the original UModeler, including **`Sketch-Based Modeling`**, **`Hotspot Texturing`**, **`Array Tool`**, **`Follow Tool`**, and more.\\n\\n**`The Pro and Team licenses`** will offer advanced features to enhance 3D content creation, such as **`AI Texturing 2.0`**, **`Curve Editor`**, and **`Pelt Unwrap`**. Additionally, new features will be continually added.\\n\\nThe technical roadmap until the first quarter of 2025 is as follows. Please note that the following list of features may be subject to change depending on circumstances.\\n\\n- **Technical Roadmap (July 2024 - March 2025)**\\n    - **July 2024 - Beta Version**\\n        - Texture Parameter Tool\\n        - Face Color Tool\\n    - **September 2024 - Plus License Early Bird Version**\\n        - Array Tool (similar to Clone Tool in UModeler)\\n        - Export Tool (supports .OBJ, .STL, .PLY)\\n        - PushPull Tool\\n        - Sketch-based Modeling\\n    - **November 2024 - Plus License Official Version**\\n        - Follow Tool\\n        - Hotspot Texturing\\n        - Multi-channel UV Editing\\n        - And more\\n    - **February 2025 - Pro, Team Licenses**\\n        - AI Texturing 2.0\\n        - Curve Editor\\n        - Pelt Unwrap\\n        - Voxel Editor\\n        - Plan Editor\\n        - And more\\n\\n## Update News\\n\\nWe would like to share the major updates of UModeler X from the past month.\\n\\nFrom version **`0.19.20`** to **`0.19.24`**, various features have been added to assist in level design.\\n\\n### New Features in the Preference Window\\n\\n![New Features in the Preference Window](./img/NewPropertiesInPreferences.png)\\n\\n- **Create As Static Object**: This option allows UModelerX Objects to be created as Static by default.\\n- **Static Option**: This option sets the Static options for UModelerX Objects when the Create As Static Object option is enabled.\\n- **Always Enable Grid Snap**: This option allows the Grid Snapping feature to always be enabled when a UModelerX Object is selected.\\n- **Create Under Root**: This option allows UModelerX Objects to be created without a parent object.\\n\\n### New Object Creation in Basic Shape Tool\\n\\nAllows new basic shapes to be created as separate objects.\\n\\n![Create Shape as a New Object](./img/CreateAsNewObject.gif)\\n\\n### Snap Panel Window\\n\\nRegister Grid Snap and Rotate Snap sizes in advance and easily select the desired snap size.\\n\\n![Snap Panel Window](./img/SnapPanel.gif)\\n\\nMany other aspects have been improved. For more detailed update news, please refer to the release notes in the online manual.\\n\\n<div class=\\"card\\">    \\n    <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">UModeler X Release Note</h3>\\n    <a href=\\"/docs/releasenote/umodelerx\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go to</a>\\n</div>"},{"id":"June-22th-2024-blog","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/June-22th-2024-blog","source":"@site/blog/2024-06-22/2024-06-22.md","title":"Low Poly Tutorials, Zepeto Guidebook, UModeler X Enhancements, and FIA Game Jam Results","description":"In this June update, we cover the completion of the Low Poly tutorial series, the release of the Zepeto item guidebook, and recent enhancements in UModeler X. We also share the exciting results from the UModeler X game jam held with FIA.","date":"2024-06-22T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"June 22, 2024","tags":[{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"Modeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/modeling"},{"label":"Rigging","permalink":"/blog/tags/rigging"},{"label":"Painting","permalink":"/blog/tags/painting"},{"label":"GameJam","permalink":"/blog/tags/game-jam"},{"label":"FIA","permalink":"/blog/tags/fia"},{"label":"Prototyping","permalink":"/blog/tags/prototyping"},{"label":"Level Design","permalink":"/blog/tags/level-design"}],"readingTime":4.865,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Low Poly Tutorials, Zepeto Guidebook, UModeler X Enhancements, and FIA Game Jam Results","description":"In this June update, we cover the completion of the Low Poly tutorial series, the release of the Zepeto item guidebook, and recent enhancements in UModeler X. We also share the exciting results from the UModeler X game jam held with FIA.","slug":"June-22th-2024-blog","authors":"jaesik","tags":["Unity","Modeling","Rigging","Painting","GameJam","FIA","Prototyping","Level Design"],"image":"./img/isometric-thumbnail.png","hide_table_of_contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"UModeler X License Model, Technical Roadmap and Latest Updates","permalink":"/blog/July-26th-2024-blog"},"nextItem":{"title":"UModeler X Latest News - Game Jam, Updates, and Achievements","permalink":"/blog/May-26th-2024-blog"}},"content":"![isometric-thumbnail](./img/isometric-thumbnail.png)\\n\\nHello, UModeler X Users!\\n\\nIn this June blog, we bring you various exciting news. From the completion of the Low Poly tutorial series and the release of the Zepeto item guidebook to the latest updates in UModeler X and the results of the game jam held with FIA, there\'s plenty to catch up on. Check out the latest developments and community activities with UModeler X!\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## Completion of the Low Poly Tutorial Series\\n\\n![LowPolyTutorialSeries](./img/Lowpoly-Tutorials-Course.png)\\n\\nThe Low Poly tutorial series for beginners is finally complete! With the newly added \\"Low Poly Isometric Room\\" tutorial, we now have a comprehensive learning course that covers everything from the basics of 3D modeling to practical projects for beginners.\\n\\nThis tutorial series is designed to be easy to follow, even for beginners, and includes the following courses:\\n\\n- **Basic Tutorial: Modeling, Rigging, and Painting Modes**\\n- **Basic Tutorial: UV Editor Guide**\\n- **Low Poly Table and Chair Tutorial Guide**\\n- **Low Poly Tower Tutorial Guide**\\n- **Low Poly Building Tutorial Guide**\\n- **New! Low Poly Isometric Room Tutorial**\\n- **Final Tutorial: Synty Studio Assets and Mixamo Animation Integration Guide**\\n\\nYou can check out the tutorials in order from the page below.\\n<div class=\\"card\\">    \\n    <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Basics Tutorial</h3>\\n    <p>This tutorial is designed for beginners to give you an overview of the features and basic usage of UModeler X.</p>\\n    <a href=\\"/docs/basics-tutorial\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Learn</a>\\n</div>\\n<br />\\n\\nEach tutorial is structured in a step-by-step manner, allowing users to practice through real projects. The newly added \\"Low Poly Isometric Room\\" tutorial, in particular, provides detailed instructions on creating an isometric style room, helping you enhance your 3D modeling skills.\\n\\nAll tutorial videos can be found on the UModeler X manual page. Each video is provided with friendly explanations, making it easy for beginners to understand and follow along.\\n\\nWe hope this tutorial series will be greatly helpful in your 3D modeling journey with UModeler X, and we look forward to bringing you even better content and features in the future.\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vV9J_3jGdW8?si=4s_4mHy27tUdyB83\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n<br />\\n<div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a57fFqkEoh4?si=Z5n0ui9d5Igkje7u\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n## Release of the Zepeto Item Guidebook\\n\\n![ZepetoGuidebook](./img/Zepeto-Guide-Book.png)\\n\\nWe are excited to introduce the newly released Zepeto Item Creation Guidebook. This guidebook covers everything from the basics to advanced applications, enabling even those who are not familiar with Unity to create Zepeto items easily using UModeler X.\\n\\nThis guidebook is extremely useful for beginners who are creating Zepeto items for the first time, as well as for intermediate and advanced users who want to create items more conveniently.\\n\\nThe guidebook includes the following contents:\\n\\n- **Chapter 1 - Getting Started with UModeler X**: Introduction to essential software and installation process.\\n- **Chapter 2 - Exploring the UModeler X Interface**: Navigating the interface and utilizing tools.\\n- **Chapter 3 - Basic Modeling**: Basic elements and functions of 3D modeling.\\n- **Chapter 4 - Modeling Application**: Applying modeling in actual projects.\\n- **Chapter 5 - UV Mapping, Texturing, and Painting**: Techniques for UV mapping and texturing.\\n- **Chapter 6 - Rigging**: Bringing models to life through rigging processes.\\n- **Chapter 7.1 - Masking**: Importance and effective creation and application of masks.\\n- **Chapter 7.2 - Upload**: How to upload completed items to Zepeto Studio.\\n\\n<div class=\\"card\\">    \\n    <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Zepeto Item Guidebook</h3>\\n    <a href=\\"/docs/zepeto-item-guidebook\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go to</a>\\n</div>\\n<br />\\n\\nThe video below is the tutorial video for Chapter 4, one of the seven videos created for the Zepeto Item Creation Guidebook.\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n    <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/x861Mo2_o1k?si=dBzV-lRpjEbA8HEI\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n<br />\\nEnjoy the process of creating Zepeto items with UModeler X through this guidebook.\\n\\n## UModeler X Update News\\nOver the past month, UModeler X has had three updates: `0.19.17`, `0.19.18`, and `0.19.19`. These updates bring various improvements that make your 3D modeling experience more convenient and efficient.\\n\\nKey updates include:\\n\\n- **Improved Vertex/Edge Picking**: The mouse cursor now highlights and allows selection when it is near edges and vertices, making element editing much easier.\\n![Improved Vertex/Edge Picking](./img/Vertex-Edge-Picking-Improvement.gif)\\n- **Distance Property Addition**: You can now input element distances numerically, enabling more precise work.\\n![Distance Property Addition](./img/Distance-field.gif)\\n- **Improved Bridge Tool**: The Bridge tool has been enhanced to easily fill holes.\\n![Improved Bridge Tool](./img/BridgeTool-FillingHole.gif)\\n- **Improved UModelerize**: Addition of Hierarchically option. Changing the setting for Merge Vertices option to be adjustable in the Preference window.\\n![Improved UModelerize](./img/UModelerize-improvement.gif)\\n- **Shortcut Addition for Backface Select in Vertex/Edge/Face Tool**: This allows for faster and more efficient work.\\n![Shortcut Addition for Backface Select](./img/Backface-shortcut.png)\\n\\nFor more details, please refer to the release notes.\\n<div class=\\"card\\">    \\n    <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">UModeler X Release Notes</h3>\\n    <a href=\\"/docs/releasenote/umodelerx\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go to</a>\\n</div>\\n<br />\\n\\nWe hope these updates will enhance your 3D modeling experience with UModeler X. We will continue to meet your expectations with ongoing improvements and updates.\\n\\n## Results of the UModeler X Game Jam with FIA\\n\\n![FIA-GameJam](./img/FIA-UModelerX-GameJam.png)\\n\\nThe Future Inspire Jam #5, held this month, has concluded successfully. This game jam saw many creative game projects using UModeler X, drawing significant attention. Here are the winning entries and major news from the jam.\\n\\n### 1st Place: \\"Without a Way Out\\" by @Alex Santos\\n\\nThis game made impressive use of UModeler\'s tools to create simple yet consistent models with more detail than other entries, earning high praise from the judges and taking the top spot.\\n\\n### 2nd Place: \\"Without-Time\\" by D.P.L.D.S\\n\\nThis game skillfully implemented a time mechanic, particularly a rewind skill, to create a short and sweet game, securing the second place with its unique idea and neat execution.\\n\\n### 3rd Place: \\"Without Movement\\" by @ojas biswas 123\\n\\nThis game innovatively changed the gameplay mechanics to fit the theme perfectly, maintaining a consistent theme and leaving a strong impression on the judges.\\n\\nThank you to everyone who participated, and we look forward to your continued interest and participation!\\n\\n- [Games Participated in the Game Jam](https://itch.io/jam/future-inspire-jam-5-value-prize/entries)\\n- [Game Jam Results](https://itch.io/jam/future-inspire-jam-5-value-prize/results)"},{"id":"May-26th-2024-blog","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/May-26th-2024-blog","source":"@site/blog/2024-05-26-GameJam-Updates-Achievements/2024-05-26-GameJam-Updates-Achievements.md","title":"UModeler X Latest News - Game Jam, Updates, and Achievements","description":"Join the UModeler X Game Jam hosted by Future Inspire Academy and explore exciting new features like the Weight Mirror and Auto Generate Mesh Collider tools. Check out UModeler X\'s success in VRChat and the newly released game, Little Kitty Big City, developed using UModeler.","date":"2024-05-26T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"May 26, 2024","tags":[{"label":"UModeler X","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x"},{"label":"Game Jam","permalink":"/blog/tags/game-jam"},{"label":"FIA","permalink":"/blog/tags/fia"},{"label":"VRChat","permalink":"/blog/tags/vr-chat"},{"label":"Litte Kitty Big City","permalink":"/blog/tags/litte-kitty-big-city"}],"readingTime":2.4,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"UModeler X Latest News - Game Jam, Updates, and Achievements","description":"Join the UModeler X Game Jam hosted by Future Inspire Academy and explore exciting new features like the Weight Mirror and Auto Generate Mesh Collider tools. Check out UModeler X\'s success in VRChat and the newly released game, Little Kitty Big City, developed using UModeler.","slug":"May-26th-2024-blog","authors":"jaesik","tags":["UModeler X","Game Jam","FIA","VRChat","Litte Kitty Big City"],"image":"./img/LittleKittyBigCity-SteamChart.png","hide_table_of_contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"Low Poly Tutorials, Zepeto Guidebook, UModeler X Enhancements, and FIA Game Jam Results","permalink":"/blog/June-22th-2024-blog"},"nextItem":{"title":"Enhancements to the Learning Process for Beginners and the Runtime VR Project and more","permalink":"/blog/April-13th-2024-blog"}},"content":"Hello UModeler X users! Today, we\'re excited to share some thrilling and valuable updates with you. In this blog post, we\'ll cover the latest news, updates, and our achievements with UModeler X.\\n\\n### UModeler X Game Jam Announcement!\\n\\n![FIA-GameJAM](./img/FutureInspireJam.png)\\n\\nFirst, let\'s talk about the **UModeler X Game Jam**. This game jam, hosted in collaboration with Future Inspire Academy (FIA), focuses on creating 3D games using Unity. FIA is a non-profit organization dedicated to providing game development education in a fun and flexible manner. They offer Unity challenges, game creation tasks, mentoring, and a gamified leaderboard to support developers worldwide.\\n\\nWe sponsor this game jam. Participants will use UModeler X\'s rigging, painting, AI texturing, and modeling features to develop creative games. All participants must submit their projects on GitHub, with primary assets created using UModeler X. For detailed rules and participation, check the links below.\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n- [UModeler X Game Jam Site](https://itch.io/jam/future-inspire-jam-5-value-prize)\\n- [FIA Discord Server](https://discord.gg/zaCmqtsETa)\\n\\n### UModeler X Update News\\n\\nOver the past month we released six updates from version **0.19.11** to **0.19.16**. Here are some of the key updates:\\n\\n- **Weight Mirror Tool Addition**\\n\\n    This tool allows you to easily copy the weight values of vertices from one side to the symmetric counterpart in symmetric objects, significantly improving efficiency.\\n\\n    <div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n        <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dPIXeVW4OM0?si=QUURErZEt7SHkg4-\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n    </div>\\n\\n- **Standard Brush Tool Improvement**\\n    \\n    You can now push in the opposite direction of the surface normal by holding the Ctrl key while brushing. Additionally, you can adjust the brush size by holding the Shift key and moving the mouse up and down.\\n\\n    <div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n        <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/r2ktoLissw8?si=52S9s5oQ5v1_o6F_\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n    </div>\\n\\n- **Auto Generate Mesh Collider Addition**\\n\\n    The Auto Generate Mesh Collider property has been added to the Preferences window and the Local Settings tool of UModeler X objects. This feature allows new objects to automatically reflect the mesh editing, enhancing level design convenience.\\n\\n    <div class=\\"video-container\\">\\n        <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gs0QMDpt7tQ?si=3lj0u0-6eH64Fqf3\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    ![MeshCollider](./img/AutoGenerateMeshCollider.png)\\n\\n### UModeler X and UModeler in VRChat Asset Picks\\n\\nWe\'re proud to announce that UModeler and UModeler X have been selected as valuable assets for VRChat content creation on the globally popular VR metaverse platform VRChat. Now, VRChat creators can use UModeler and UModeler X to craft even more impressive content.\\n\\n- [VRChat Picks in the Unity Asset Store](https://assetstore.unity.com/lists/vrchat-picks-125734)\\n\\n![VRChatPick](./img/VRChatPicks-UModeler-UModelerX.png)\\n\\n### Little Kitty Big City Game Release\\n\\nFinally, we\'re thrilled to announce the release of the game Little Kitty Big City, developed using the predecessor of UModeler X, UModeler. This game is now available on Steam, XBox and Nintendo Switch, and it has been well-received by gamers worldwide. This success story underscores the excellence of UModeler. Enjoy enhanced productivity with UModeler and UModeler X.\\n\\n- [XBox](https://www.xbox.com/en-US/games/store/little-kitty-big-city/9NF5S7MLM8XT)\\n- [Steam](https://store.steampowered.com/app/1177980/Little_Kitty_Big_City)\\n- [Nintendo Switch](https://www.nintendo.com/us/store/products/little-kitty-big-city-switch)\\n\\n![LittleKittyBigCity-SteamChart](./img/LittleKittyBigCity-SteamChart.png)\\n![LittleKittyBigCity-Reviews](./img/LittleKittyBigCity-Reviews.png)\\n\\n---\\n\\nThese are the latest updates from UModeler X. We hope you continue to enjoy creating with UModeler X. Stay tuned for more updates and exciting news!"},{"id":"April-13th-2024-blog","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/April-13th-2024-blog","source":"@site/blog/2024-04-13-BeginnerTutorialEnhancement/2024-04-13-BeginnerTutorialEnhancement.md","title":"Enhancements to the Learning Process for Beginners and the Runtime VR Project and more","description":"New tutorial videos for beginners have been added, and the overall learning process has been enhanced. Also, check out the news about the VR experiment project created with UModeler X.","date":"2024-04-13T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"April 13, 2024","tags":[{"label":"Learning Course Enhancement","permalink":"/blog/tags/learning-course-enhancement"},{"label":"VR","permalink":"/blog/tags/vr"},{"label":"Blacksmith","permalink":"/blog/tags/blacksmith"},{"label":"UModelerX-Update","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x-update"}],"readingTime":3.395,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Enhancements to the Learning Process for Beginners and the Runtime VR Project and more","description":"New tutorial videos for beginners have been added, and the overall learning process has been enhanced. Also, check out the news about the VR experiment project created with UModeler X.","slug":"April-13th-2024-blog","authors":"jaesik","tags":["Learning Course Enhancement","VR","Blacksmith","UModelerX-Update"],"image":"./img/UModelerXLearningCourse.png","hide_table_of_contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"UModeler X Latest News - Game Jam, Updates, and Achievements","permalink":"/blog/May-26th-2024-blog"},"nextItem":{"title":"Online Manual Revamp, HDRP/URP Improvements, and New Tutorials","permalink":"/blog/Mar-16th-2024-blog"}},"content":"![BeginnerLearningCourses](./img/UModelerXLearningCourse.png)\\n\\n### Enhancements to the UModeler X Tutorial Courses for Beginners\\n\\nThe tutorial course for beginners in UModeler X has been newly strengthened, making it easy for anyone to enter the world of 3D modeling. Now, after learning the basics of modeling, rigging, and painting, you can proceed with practice-like exercises through low poly modeling. The newly added \'Lowpoly Table and Chair\' and \'Lowpoly Tower\' tutorial videos will be an excellent next step for those who have completed the basic education.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dvusbq7o6jo?si=brsXyJUJCLOgPYUc\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n<br></br>\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wYPISerxOys?si=-1reDDQzjdSh4bSr\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\nBeginners are recommended to gradually learn the various features of UModeler X according to the tutorial course below. Each tutorial can be easily accessed through the provided links.\\n\\n1. **Basic Tutorials**\\n    - Learn the basics of modeling, rigging, and painting.\\n    - You can master the basics of UV editing.\\n    - Link: **[Basic Tutorials](/docs/basics-tutorial)**\\n2. **Low Poly Tutorials**\\n    - Start with a simple table and chair and move on to towers and buildings.\\n    - A low poly student room production tutorial will also be added soon.\\n    - Link: **[Low Poly Tutorials](/docs/low-poly-guide)**\\n3. **Synty Studios and Mixamo**\\n    - Apply animations to your finished models.\\n    - Link: **[Synty Studios and Mixamo](/docs/synty-mixamo-animation-integration)**\\n\\nThis systematic tutorial course is designed to allow users who are new to UModeler X to learn step-by-step, from the basics to practical application. This tutorial will be a good guide on your journey to creating your own creations.\\n\\n### UModeler X VR Prototype Project\\n    \\nThe UModeler X team, led by lead developer **Kim Se-yong**, conducted an innovative internal project called \'VR BlackSmith\' to deeply explore the potential of the release version. This project aimed to integrate ancient blacksmith techniques into a modern VR environment. It was about implementing the traditional method of forging iron and making tools in a VR setting using UModeler X\'s advanced modeling technology.\\n\\nThe project was carried out by dedicating 20% of **Kim Se-yong**\'s working hours from January to March. During this time, the focus was on meticulously testing and improving the modeling functionality of UModeler X and the runtime performance of the Boolean tool. These efforts confirmed that UModeler X could perform excellently in real-time environments.\\n\\nDuring the development process, the flexibility and powerful modeling capabilities of UModeler X were deeply explored for VR content creation. As a result, the \'VR BlackSmith\' project successfully developed a prototype that allows users to experience blacksmith techniques and create tools within the VR environment using UModeler X\'s features.\\n\\nThe project\'s achievements, despite being a prototype version, are demonstrated in a demo video, showcasing the core functionalities of UModeler X and proving its potential. The experiences and insights gained from this project will have a significant impact on the future development direction of UModeler X.\\n\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z_ylIiNGFF4?si=IEwqt_ZQFGNxrT_V\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n<br></br>\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ryoE1qjbpgI?si=eF2Nh_1ZVkoCZt-s\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n### UModeler X Updates Over the Last Month\\n\\nThe updates to UModeler X over the last month have focused on improvements to modeling and painting modes, as well as performance enhancements for the UV editor and 3D painting. Version 0.19.6 addressed GPU crash issues, and versions 0.19.8 and 0.19.9 fixed various bugs to enhance the usability of modeling tools. Notably, the functionality of the bevel tool and slice cut tool was improved, and the accuracy of Boolean operations was enhanced, significantly improving the user experience. Additionally, issues with shortcuts in rigging and painting modes were resolved, increasing stability.\\n\\nFor more detailed update information, please refer to [UModeler X\'s release notes](/docs/releasenote/umodelerx).\\n\\nUModeler X is moving towards a more stable version based on issues reported by you through the [UModeler Discord server](https://discord.com/invite/Pfct3hf) and [email](mailto:contact.support@umodeler.com)."},{"id":"Mar-16th-2024-blog","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/Mar-16th-2024-blog","source":"@site/blog/2024-03-16-Online-Manual-Update-and-more/2024-03-16-Online-Manual-Update-and-more.md","title":"Online Manual Revamp, HDRP/URP Improvements, and New Tutorials","description":"The revamp of the online manual, the improvements for HDRP and URP, and the launch of new low-poly tutorials are designed to enhance user convenience and support various use cases. This update aims to improve user experience by reflecting feedback from indie game developers and the UModeler X community and striving for continuous improvement.","date":"2024-03-16T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"March 16, 2024","tags":[{"label":"update news","permalink":"/blog/tags/update-news"},{"label":"online-manual","permalink":"/blog/tags/online-manual"},{"label":"HDRP","permalink":"/blog/tags/hdrp"},{"label":"URP","permalink":"/blog/tags/urp"},{"label":"low poly building","permalink":"/blog/tags/low-poly-building"}],"readingTime":3.475,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Online Manual Revamp, HDRP/URP Improvements, and New Tutorials","description":"The revamp of the online manual, the improvements for HDRP and URP, and the launch of new low-poly tutorials are designed to enhance user convenience and support various use cases. This update aims to improve user experience by reflecting feedback from indie game developers and the UModeler X community and striving for continuous improvement.","slug":"Mar-16th-2024-blog","authors":"jaesik","tags":["update news","online-manual","HDRP","URP","low poly building"],"image":"./img/low-poly-buildings.png","hide_table_of_contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"Enhancements to the Learning Process for Beginners and the Runtime VR Project and more","permalink":"/blog/April-13th-2024-blog"},"nextItem":{"title":"The Latest UModeler X Updates - What\'s New in January and February 2024","permalink":"/blog/Feb-2024-Latest-Update"}},"content":"import UModelerUSAPatent from \'./img/UModeler-USA-Patent.png\';\\n\\nHello,\\n\\nIn this blog post, we\'ll share updates about the online manual, updates related to URP/HDRP for UModeler X, and news about our new tutorial videos.\\n\\n![onlinemanualupdate](./img/low-poly-buildings.png)\\n\\n### Online Manual Update\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nFirstly, we integrated the **Release Notes** and **FAQ page**, which were on separate sites and somewhat inconvenient to access, into the online manual. At the same time, we separated some of the FAQ content dealing with error handling into a separate **Trouble Shooting page** to make it easier for users to address errors that occur during authentication and when using UModeler X.\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Release Note</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"/docs/releasenote\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Check</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">FAQ</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"/docs/FAQ\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Check</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Trouble Shooting</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"/docs/troubleshooting\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Check</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\nWe also added a new **The Use of UModeler X** category to gather content on how to apply UModeler X. Currently, you can find videos on low-poly modeling, guides for collaboration with Synty Studio and Mixamo, and various videos on creating items for Zepeto in this category. We plan to continuously update this space with documents and videos on various UModeler X tips and techniques.\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Low Poly Guide</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"/docs/low-poly-guide\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Check</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Synty and Mixamo Collabo</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"/docs/synty-mixamo-animation-integration\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Check</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">Zepeto Item</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"/docs/zepeto-item-creation-tutorials\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Check</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\nAs many of you know, not only the existing UModeler meshes but also general static meshes and skinned meshes can be converted into UModeler X meshes for direct editing in Unity. We have gathered guides related to this in the **Getting Started > Mesh Data Conversion** category to make them more accessible.\\n\\n![onlinemanualupdate](./img/online-update.png)\\n\\n### URP/HDRP Issue Fixes and Improvements\\n\\nWith the UModeler X 0.19.4 update, we have resolved most of the issues that arose with URP and HDRP. For example, the issue where hidden elements were selected when Camera Based Select was activated, and issues that occurred in modeling/rigging/painting modes when using tools with brushes, have been fixed.\\n\\n### Low-Poly Building Tutorial Released\\n\\nWe released a tutorial video on making low-poly buildings. A user\'s request recently made us realize that we had not created demos or videos related to low-poly due to focusing on showing that UModeler X is capable of high-poly modeling, rigging, and painting. Many indie game developers likely use UModeler X for creating low-poly meshes. So starting with this low-poly building tutorial video, we plan to create various low-poly tutorial videos. I will make time to create and showcase tutorials on mugs, chairs, towers, barrels, etc. If there\'s a tutorial you would like to see, please suggest it on our Discord server. These tutorials are also easy for me to make quickly using UModeler X, even though I come from a programmer background.\\n\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EOUHbMZC5TU?si=CciOh4_UZGlg4qu7\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n### Obtaining a US Patent for 3D Modeling Technology\\n\\nUModeler Inc. has obtained a patent in the United States for a \\"METHOD AND 3D MODELING ENGINE FOR MANAGING MODELING DATA DURING 3D MODELING\\". This technology covers an efficient method for creating and editing 3D data in a real-time graphics environment. Thanks to this, it has been possible to develop a high-performance 3D modeling solution in the Unity editor using the C# language. \\n\\n<img src={UModelerUSAPatent} width=\\"300\\"/>\\n\\n### GDC 2024\\n\\nWe will be attending GDC 2024 in San Francisco from March 20th to 22nd. We\'re so excited about attending GDC after a long time. If anyone else is going, please contact me via email (contact.support@umodeler.com) or DM on Discord/Facebook. I\'ll share the news from GDC when we return.\\n\\n![gdc2024](./img/gdc2024.png)\\n\\n### Conclusion\\n\\nThat\'s all for this blog update. The various issues and feedback that you share via Discord and email play a significant role in making UModeler X more stable and useful. If you encounter any inconveniences while using UModeler X, please feel free to inform us through the UModeler Discord server or email.\\n\\n<div class=\\"card-container\\">\\n    <div class=\\"card\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\"card-title\\">UModeler Discord Server</h3>\\n        <a href=\\"https://discord.gg/7vwKpvdGXy\\" class=\\"card-link\\">Go Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\nWe\'ll return with more new content in the next blog. See you then!"},{"id":"Feb-2024-Latest-Update","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/Feb-2024-Latest-Update","source":"@site/blog/2024-02-26-Latest-Update/2024-02-26-Latest-Update.md","title":"The Latest UModeler X Updates - What\'s New in January and February 2024","description":"This blog post helps you get started with the painting mode.","date":"2024-02-26T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"February 26, 2024","tags":[{"label":"update news","permalink":"/blog/tags/update-news"},{"label":"backlog","permalink":"/blog/tags/backlog"},{"label":"painting-mode-guide","permalink":"/blog/tags/painting-mode-guide"},{"label":"unity3d","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity-3-d"},{"label":"3dmodeling","permalink":"/blog/tags/3-dmodeling"},{"label":"gamedev","permalink":"/blog/tags/gamedev"},{"label":"indiedev","permalink":"/blog/tags/indiedev"},{"label":"metaverse","permalink":"/blog/tags/metaverse"}],"readingTime":2.46,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"The Latest UModeler X Updates - What\'s New in January and February 2024","description":"This blog post helps you get started with the painting mode.","slug":"Feb-2024-Latest-Update","authors":"jaesik","tags":["update news","backlog","painting-mode-guide","unity3d","3dmodeling","gamedev","indiedev","metaverse"],"image":"./img/SmallShip_2_HD.png","hide_table_of_contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"Online Manual Revamp, HDRP/URP Improvements, and New Tutorials","permalink":"/blog/Mar-16th-2024-blog"},"nextItem":{"title":"Starting the UModeler blog","permalink":"/blog/hello-umodeler"}},"content":"![](./img/SmallShip_2_HD.png)\\n\\nHello everyone! I\'m very happy to introduce our second blog post. Today, we\'ll talk about the major updates made over the last two months, the newly added painting mode guide, and the backlog we are working on to make UModeler X even more stable.\\n\\n## Major Updates for January and February 2024\\n\\nSeveral useful features were added in January and February this year. Take a look, and if you\'re still using an older version of UModeler X, I hope you take this opportunity to update to the latest version.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n### [Ruler Feature](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/modeling-element/#ruler)\\nYou can easily measure the distance between selected vertices and the length of edges.\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n  <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gE_8MPFK9qo?si=DdX8xkGe7zdehA1r\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n### [Improved Snapping Function](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/modeling-element/#vertex-snapping)\\nhe Height Snap feature has been added, allowing elements to be aligned based on the direction of movement and the position of the cursor. Additionally, Unity\'s Grid/Incremental snap functionality has been integrated into the basic shape tools. This improves accuracy and ease of use.\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n  <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qhfd3fry93U?si=bZWOzZwd5swZiM1c\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n### [Added View Cut Function](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/modeling/slicecut-tool/#view-cut)\\nWith the new Slice Cut tool, you can easily slice meshes by creating a virtual plane that matches the camera direction.\\n\\n<div class=\\"video-container-4-3\\">\\n  <iframe src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-Bukl1N_JB4?si=eXtfK_A7LD-gnCAR\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allowfullscreen=\\"\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n### [Shortcut](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/shortcuts)\\nIn UModeler X, you can assign shortcuts for all tools using Unity\'s shortcut manager.\\n\\n![Unity Shortcut Manager](../../docs/getting-started/img/UModelerX-ShortcutSystem.gif)\\n\\n### [Decimate Modifier](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/modeling/decimate-modifier)\\nWith the new Decimate modifier, you can reduce the number of polygons in a mesh to efficiently optimize the model.\\n\\n![Decimate Ratio](../../docs/editable-mesh/modeling-mode/modeling-mode-modifier/img/Modeling_Modifier_Decimate_Ratio.png)\\n\\n### Commentary Feature\\nCheck your UModeler X usage status with the new Commentary feature. It provides information on the tools you are using, mouse/keyboard inputs, and Undo/Redo actions.\\n\\nIn addition to these feature additions, many improvements have been made. For more update news, please refer to the [UModeler Discord channel](https://discord.gg/w2PfG5xFzP).\\n\\n## [Painting Mode Guide](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/painting-guide)\\n\\nA guide document for users starting with the painting mode has been added to the manual page. It\'s a very convenient feature that allows you to create or modify textures directly on 3D models. This guide provides useful information on how to start painting mode and how to use textures created in this mode.\\n\\n## Current Ongoing Backlogs\\n\\nBased on your feedback, we are working hard to update UModeler X every week. The backlog items scheduled to be addressed in the next 2-3 weeks are as follows.\\n\\n- Performance issues when navigating the camera with the mouse in edit mode.\\n- Addition of a feature to reset properties in the LoopCut tool.\\n- Problems with selecting hidden polygons.\\n- Rendering issues when a disabled UModelerXEditableMesh component is reactivated.\\n- Unity freezing when saving the scene.\\n- Hierarchy problems occurring when umodelerizing multiple meshes.\\n- Improvement of painting brush speed.\\n\\n## Conclusion\\n\\nWe hope your 3D modeling experience improves with UModeler X, and we will always listen to your valuable feedback. Your interest and support are the driving forces behind the development of UModeler X. Please continue to support us."},{"id":"hello-umodeler","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/hello-umodeler","source":"@site/blog/2024-02-16-hello-umodeler/2024-02-16-hello-umodeler.md","title":"Starting the UModeler blog","description":"This is the first post on UModeler.","date":"2024-02-16T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"February 16, 2024","tags":[{"label":"hello","permalink":"/blog/tags/hello"},{"label":"welcome","permalink":"/blog/tags/welcome"},{"label":"first","permalink":"/blog/tags/first"},{"label":"UModeler-X","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler-x"},{"label":"UModeler","permalink":"/blog/tags/u-modeler"},{"label":"Unity","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity"},{"label":"Unity3D","permalink":"/blog/tags/unity-3-d"}],"readingTime":9.3,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Jaesik Hwang","title":"Founder and CEO","email":"Jaesik.H@umodeler.com","imageURL":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/250891_b2b0d03187384b15b524e4b7fab08915~mv2.png","key":"jaesik"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Starting the UModeler blog","description":"This is the first post on UModeler.","slug":"hello-umodeler","authors":"jaesik","tags":["hello","welcome","first","UModeler-X","UModeler","UModelerX","Unity","Unity3D"],"image":"https://docs.umodeler.com/assets/images/Manual_Intro_Main-8a771b72d9edba351f4310e65d76dde5.png","hide_table_of_contents":false},"prevItem":{"title":"The Latest UModeler X Updates - What\'s New in January and February 2024","permalink":"/blog/Feb-2024-Latest-Update"}},"content":"![](./img/SpaceShip_Render_02.png)\\n\\nHello! I\'m very excited to start a blog like this. I was thinking about what to write for my first blog post, and I decided it would be interesting to talk about why we started developing UModeler X, the process we went through, and how we plan to develop it further, as this is something we haven\'t had many chances to discuss.\\n\\nThe reason I started developing UModeler X while the existing UModeler was receiving a lot of love from Unity developers is as follows:\\n\\n1. To allow for smooth editing of high-poly 3D data within the Unity editor.\\n2. To integrate all functions needed for 3D data creation, including modeling, rigging, painting, and sculpting, so that games can be made 100% within Unity.\\n3. To lay the groundwork for runtime solution development as well as editor solutions, aiming to develop new products for more 3D creators outside of Unity.\\n4. To allow creators to make various contents such as 3D worlds, games, items, and characters with UModeler X, and to support more creators\' creative activities with the results produced from here.\\n\\n## UModeler X Development Story\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nUModeler X began its full-scale development in mid-2020, facing various technical and planning challenges. We overcame these challenges one by one to reach its current form. I will briefly introduce the development process.\\n\\n### In 2020\\n\\n- In 2020, the initial development focused on implementing an architecture that could quickly update the connectivity information between the elements of a mesh, such as vertices, edges, and faces. Additionally, we concentrated on ensuring that the visualization, selection, and movement of these mesh elements could be handled cleanly and swiftly. [The BMesh architecture from Blender](https://developer.blender.org/docs/features/objects/mesh/bmesh/) provided significant help in implementing this architecture. To verify performance, we conducted basic modeling tests such as element selection and movement using an 800,000 polygon Stanford Dragon mesh. The results confirmed that UModeler X could adequately edit high-poly models within Unity.\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VDkCZsiGqt8?si=IUBPp5x9Hmwyss1e\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n- In addition to this, we introduced a command-based modular approach to increase work efficiency and significantly reduce the data size needed for Undo/Redo operations.\\n- We also added the ability to modify the original mesh (Source Mesh) without altering it by introducing modifiers (Modifier). The initial implementation of the Mirror, Subdivide, FFD, Shell, and Push modifiers has made modeling much easier and more efficient.\\n- We adopted the OpenSubdiv library to implement a subdivision (Subdivision) tool that directly converts low-quality, low-poly 3D data into high-quality, high-poly 3D data.\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tJdEban56U0?si=Wob271mldoZLCPAj\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n### In 2021\\n\\n- We introduced the [MVVM(Model-View-ViewModel)](https://learn.microsoft.com/ko-kr/dotnet/architecture/maui/mvvm) pattern to separate rendering, data, and actual implementation. Additionally, we upgraded the UI design to make it more sophisticated.\\n- We developed a solution that utilizes the GPU to select vertices, edges, and faces of high-poly meshes with high performance.\\n- We implemented various modeling-related features belonging to basic shapes (Primitive Shapes), Add, Remove, and Surface groups on top of the new architecture. \\n- We also implemented a built-in UV editor to enable UV unwrapping and editing.\\n- In the summer of 2021, we were able to create high-end 3D models that the original UModeler could not achieve, fully utilizing the features of UModeler X implemented up to that point.\\n![](./img/UModelerX-FirstDemoShots.png)\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tv8-J1h6Msc?si=LmVNkZmfBPsX4HQV\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n- In UV editing, a new unwrapping feature using the LSCM (Least Squares Conformal Maps) algorithm was added, allowing complex meshes to be unfolded into 2D UV coordinates with minimal distortion by following the seams.\\n![](./img/UVEditor-LSCM.png)\\n- We finally implemented rigging for character animation. Now, not only can you create a skeleton structure, but you can also import and use an existing skeleton directly. Additionally, we implemented the Weight Transfer feature, which calculates weights based on the weights of another mesh. By fully utilizing the modeling features and rigging implemented up to that point, we were able to successfully create character items for the Zepeto metaverse, thereby verifying the performance of UModeler X.\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1vmfEH6R_6Y?si=ozpW5XHL9HKOKBnu\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n### In 2022\\n\\n- We continuously verified the capabilities of UModeler X by creating a demo that combined a cute character with a 2.5D proportion, made using UModeler X, with a background created using UModeler.\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S1s8CWK0zO8?si=QEh0jUgMgH8aNhXM\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n- Developed a 3D painting mode that allows direct coloring on 3D models with a brush. This supports layers like Photoshop, and each layer can have Paint, Fill, and Sticker properties. 2D painting is also supported, making it possible to create textures in Unity, which was previously cumbersome.\\n  - **3D Painting Prototype**\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dYMkU94AML8?si=TP_KAcqr4EoUgSTw\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n  - **First Version of 3D Painting**\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/g9W0eM9EBcU?si=uo_B3HiHZcPnPa_D\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n- Conducted more than three alpha tests targeting students learning Unity. Through this, we were able to receive a wide range of feedback and enhance the completeness of UModeler X.\\n- In 2022, a lot of time and effort were invested in adding new features, creating a stable and scalable system, and addressing technical debt. As a result, the existing command system, prefab, and tool usage workflows were significantly improved. Continuous testing led to the identification and resolution of many issues. While these improvements may not seem significant externally, they ultimately laid the groundwork for a stronger leap forward.\\n\\n### In 2023\\n\\n- **First Closed Beta (March 2023~)**\\n  - Conducted a closed beta for Zepeto creators. Zepeto uses Unity as a development studio for creators.\\n  - Launched a landing page in January and granted access to users who left their emails on March 29.\\n  - Although the number of people who actually used UModeler X was not as high as the number who applied, we were able to receive helpful feedback from real Zepeto creators, which greatly aided in improving UModeler X.\\n  - Improved rigging and export features to accommodate various body types of Zepeto.\\n![](./img/UModelerX-Zepeto-Test.png)\\n  - Opened [the Official UModeler X Manual Site](https://docs.umodeler.com/docs/intro), built using the Docusaurus solution.\\n- **Second Closed Beta (July 2023~)**\\n  - Held an invitation event. Invitations could be received either from someone who was already invited or by applying directly on the website. In retrospect, it might have been better not to conduct this event as part of a viral marketing strategy.\\n  - Began to inform existing UModeler users about UModeler X. We created a new UModeler X category in the UModeler Discord channel and simultaneously announced the news of UModeler X\'s second closed beta in communities where Unity developers are active.\\n  - Released the first demo video.\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Mxfhrq3g_x0?si=RbUa3c9vFk6q4jJH\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n  - Released tutorial videos to help get started with UModeler X, serving as an excellent guide.\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/53rFgSVLwMM?si=T-b4cv15bQG1QlD-\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/--loU3ihpTc?si=fhsMLygydFCDso1_\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n  - Added an auto-rigging feature similar to the Mixamo concept. Setting guide points automatically generates a skeleton for human and quadruped meshes and assigns weights to vertices.\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SgSUYtcIn4g?si=NkAPWJi9cnOtGFCs\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n  - Implemented AI texturing in collaboration with the game company [nerdystar](https://nerdystar.io/), working with Stable Diffusion + WebUI. This allows for direct projection of AI-generated images onto 3D models in the scene view, simplifying the cumbersome texture creation process.\\n![](./img/UModelerX-nerdystar-AI-texturing-1.gif)\\n![](./img/UModelerX-nerdystar-AI-texturing-2.gif)\\n- **Open Beta (September 2023~)**\\n  - From this point on, anyone can use UModeler X simply by signing up.\\n  - Released the second demo video.\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7FxjSyy3dfU?si=jwCj-krvncNfzsNm\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n- Launched UModeler X on the Unity Asset Store. Now anyone can download UModeler Hub from the Asset Store and use UModeler X.\\n  - [UModeler X with AI-Texturing](https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-x-with-ai-texturing-254983)    \\n- Opened a course on [Unity\'s Official Online Learning Site (learn.unity.com)](https://learn.unity.com/project/getting-started-with-umodelerx) for getting started with UModeler X.\\n  - [Getting Started with UModelerX - Unity Learn](https://learn.unity.com/project/getting-started-with-umodelerx)\\n- Created a demo video showcasing the advantages of using UModeler X with Synty Studios\' assets in Unity, allowing for direct editing and animation.\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NMYy8VcstUI?si=VJclM0DTiyuhEKOb\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n## In the future\\n\\nOur goal with UModeler X is to upgrade the Unity editor, used by over 1.1 million people monthly, into an easier and more convenient tool for creating 3D content. If anyone using the Unity editor can fully unleash their imagination with UModeler X, the world will become more exciting and colorful. To achieve such a world, UModeler X will continue to develop and evolve without cease.\\n\\n### In 2024\\n\\nThis year, we plan to implement the sketch-based smart modeling that made the original UModeler special, into UModeler X as well. Also, hotspot texturing and the Curve editor are expected to be integrated into UModeler X soon. Additionally, AI Texturing version 2.0 is waiting for you. We are preparing many more features, so you can look forward to them.\\n\\n## Getting Started with UModeler X\\n\\nTo install UModeler X, you first need to install the Hub from the [Unity Asset Store](https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/umodeler-x-with-ai-texturing-254983). This Hub is responsible for the installation and updating of UModeler X and allows for the download of other necessary assets. After running the Hub, create an account and log in to install UModeler X.\\n\\n<div className=\\"video-container\\" style={{ width: \'100%\', height: ``}}>\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rr8tbw3CRtk?si=ZHxFS3cfsDscdVL8\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div>\\nOnce the installation is complete, you can start using it right away by referring to the previously introduced UModeler X online manual.<br/>\\n\\n## Community and Support Channels\\n\\nIf you have any improvements, questions, or issues you\'d like to discuss while using UModeler X, try using the UModeler Discord server. You can receive direct feedback from developers or other UModeler X users there. You can also get the latest news about UModeler X on this server. Feel free to inquire through the UModeler Unity Forum or Email.\\n\\n- [UModeler Discord Server](https://discord.com/invite/VH4yR8R)\\n- [Unity UModeler Forum](https://forum.unity.com/threads/released-umodeler-x-model-rig-paint-and-ai-texture-within-unity-unity-vsp.462506/)\\n- contact.support@umodeler.com\\n\\n\\n## Resources\\n\\nFor the latest information, follow UModeler on [Twitter](https://twitter.com/docusaurus), [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/umodeler), and [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/_umodeler_/)."}]}')}}]);